ription":"Families fleeing Israeli airstrikes in southern Lebanon and other areas that have been attacked are flocking to Martyr's Square in Beirut. NBC News' Richard Engel reports that many there fear what happened in Gaza will happen to them as well.","thumbnailUrl":["https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/mpx/2704722219/2024_09/1727714225547_n_mitchell_brk_lebanon_invasion_fears_240930_1920x1080-q55sqq.jpg"],"contentUrl":"https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/nbcnews/video/2024/09/1727714225547_n_mitchell_brk_lebanon_invasion_fears_240930_6.mp4?format=redirect","duration":"PT4M38S","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"uploadDate":"2024-09-30T16:37:25.000Z","url":"https://www.msnbc.com/andrea-mitchell-reports/watch/displaced-families-crowd-beirut-streets-as-fears-of-israeli-invasion-grow-220453957512","caption":[{"@type":"MediaObject","encodingFormat":"srt","url":"https://nbcnewsdigital-static.nbcuni.com/media/captions/NBC_News_Digital/2024/09/1727714225547_n_mitchell_brk_lebanon_invasion_fears_240930.srt","inLanguage":"en"},{"@type":"MediaObject","encodingFormat":"vtt","url":"https://nbcnewsdigital-static.nbcuni.com/media/captions/NBC_News_Digital/2024/09/1727714225547_n_mitchell_brk_lebanon_invasion_fears_240930.vtt","inLanguage":"en"}]}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"NewsArticle","headline":"Israeli forces begin 'targeted' ground operation in Lebanon, IDF says","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218","thumbnailUrl":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_social_share_1024x768_scale,f_auto,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","alternativeHeadline":"Israeli forces begin 'targeted' ground operation in Lebanon, IDF says","dateModified":"2024-10-01T08:00:17.947Z","datePublished":"2024-09-30T08:12:16.441Z","articleSection":"news","identifier":{"@type":"PropertyValue","propertyID":"uid","value":"rcna173218"},"inLanguage":"en","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "},"author":[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com"}],"publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"description":"Follow NBC News' live coverage as Israel strikes Iran-backed groups across the Middle East after killing Hezbollah leader Hassan Nasrallah, and the Lebanon death toll rises.","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218"},"keywords":"","contributor":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Freddie Clayton","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2026_05/3717929/250127_1x1_nbc_headshots_freddie_clayton_5339.jpg","description":"Freddie Clayton is a freelance journalist based in London. "}]}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"LiveBlogPosting","thumbnailUrl":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_social_share_1024x768_scale,f_auto,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "},"author":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218","coverageStartTime":"2024-09-30T08:12:16.441Z","coverageEndTime":"2024-10-01T06:12:16.000Z","datePublished":"2024-09-30T08:12:16.441Z","dateModified":"2024-10-01T05:17:55.202Z","headline":"Israeli forces begin 'targeted' ground operation in Lebanon, IDF says","alternativeHeadline":"Israeli forces begin 'targeted' ground operation in Lebanon, IDF says","description":"Follow NBC News' live coverage as Israel strikes Iran-backed groups across the Middle East after killing Hezbollah leader Hassan Nasrallah, and the Lebanon death toll rises.","liveBlogUpdate":[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57634"},"headline":"Japan has 'grave concern' over Israel's incursion","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57634","datePublished":"2024-10-01T05:07:43.539Z","dateModified":"2024-10-01T05:17:55.202Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Arata Yamamoto","description":"Arata Yamamoto has been an NBC News producer in Tokyo since 1993."}],"articleBody":"Japan would much rather see a cease-fire between Israel and foes to its west and north than the limited ground incursion targeting Hezbollah fighters in Lebanon, Japan’s chief cabinet secretary said at his daily news briefing.\n\n“Amidst calls by the international community for restraint for all parties concerned ... Israel conducted a ground operation in Lebanon,” Yoshimasa Hayashi said. \n\n“Japan expresses its grave concern,” he added.\n\nYoshimasa called for Israel and its enemies to lay down their arms and perform the following: do earnest work on a diplomatic solution, show restraint on the battlefield, implement measures to prevent civilian casualties, comply with international humanitarian laws and implement a United Nations resolution, known as 1701, that calls on peacekeeping forces and Lebanese soldiers to maintain a zone between Israel and Hezbollah fighters.\n\nAbout 50 Japanese citizens are in Lebanon, Hayashi said. The country is prepared to do whatever is needed to get them out, he said, including using Self-Defense Force aircraft for evacuations.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57580"},"headline":"Video shows smoke and explosions in distance at Beirut airport ","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57580","datePublished":"2024-10-01T04:08:09.539Z","dateModified":"2024-10-01T04:08:09.539Z","author":[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com"}],"articleBody":"Smoke can be seen in the distance as explosions happen at Beirut-Rafic Hariri International Airport shortly after officials said Israel’s ground incursion into Lebanon had begun.","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/mpx/2704722219/2024_10/f_mo_beirut_airport_explosions_240930.00_00_08_25.Still001-ughiuv.jpg"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57593"},"headline":"Critics question Israel's description of ground operation","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57593","datePublished":"2024-10-01T02:47:00.622Z","dateModified":"2024-10-01T03:19:21.812Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Doha Madani","jobTitle":"Senior Breaking News Reporter","description":"Doha Madani is a senior breaking news reporter for NBC News. Pronouns: she/her.","disambiguatingDescription":"I did my undergraduate studies in government and journalism at the University of Tampa before obtaining a master's degree in international reporting at the CUNY Graduate School of Journalism. My byline has appeared at the Tampa Tribune, Lebanon's The Daily Star, and HuffPost. While at NBC News I've had the privilege of covering some of our biggest stories including the pandemic, the Depp-Heard trial, the Supreme Court's Dobbs decision, and the Israel-Hamas war. ","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/doha-madani-ncpn915866","sameAs":["https://x.com/dohamadani"]}],"articleBody":"Some critics have expressed skepticism about the description of Israel’s ground operation in Lebanon as “targeted,” recalling similar representations of Israel’s ground assault into Rafah in May. \n\nBiden had threatened to withhold arms from Israel if there was a major ground offensive in Rafah but later said the offensive did not cross his administration's “red line” because it was limited to a strategic area in order to fight Hamas.\n\nIn July, NBC News was able to visit the city and documented a devastated ghost town. Buildings were completely leveled, and there was almost no one to be found, whereas just weeks before it was home to more than 1 million Palestinians.  ","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57499"},"headline":"British families of Israeli hostages tell Netanyahu to make a deal for their return","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57499","datePublished":"2024-10-01T01:24:32.856Z","dateModified":"2024-10-01T01:31:15.404Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Mirna Alsharif","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2022_46/3581066/mirna-alsharif-byline-jm.jpg","jobTitle":"Reporter, Breaking News","description":"Mirna Alsharif is a breaking news reporter for NBC News.","disambiguatingDescription":"Prior to  NBC News, I wrote for CNN where I covered some of the biggest stories of the past five years, including the killing of George Floyd and the outset of the Covid-19 pandemic.","award":"I was a finalist for AMEJA's (Arab and Middle Eastern Journalists Association) Excellence in Reporting Awards in the category \"Best coverage of Arab and Middle Eastern heritage communities in North America.\"","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/mirna-alsharif-ncpn1297517","sameAs":["https://www.instagram.com/mirna_alsharif","https://x.com/mirna_alsharif"]}],"articleBody":"British families of Israeli hostages had a message for Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu at a London news conference today: make a deal so their loved ones can come home.\n\n“My message to him is to listen to the people of Israel and get that deal,” said Sharone Lifschitz, whose father, Oded, 84, remains in captivity in Gaza after he was captured on Oct. 7. Lifschitz's mother, Yocheved, was freed last year as part of an exchange for Palestinian prisoners.  \n\n“I don't think that he should wait until after the election to reach a deal. There is the possibility of a deal now, and what is missing is the will of both sides,” she added. \n\nStephen Brisley, whose brother-in-law Eli Sharabi, 52, remains in Gaza, called on Netanyahu to “become statesmanlike and do the right thing and secure a deal.” \n\n“Too long has passed with the deal in various iterations over the last six or eight months,\" Brisley said. \"It’s unfathomable to me that it’s been impossible to get one of those deals over the line.\"","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57506"},"headline":"World is 'safer' without Hezbollah leader, Blinken says","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57506","datePublished":"2024-10-01T00:18:31.034Z","dateModified":"2024-10-01T00:33:51.393Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Anthony Landahl","description":"Anthony Landahl "}],"articleBody":"Secretary of State Antony Blinken called Hezbollah leader Hassan Nasrallah a “brutal terrorist” today and said Lebanon, the Middle East and the world are safer without him.\n\nSpeaking at the D-ISIS Ministerial meeting at the State Department, Blinken also underscored that pursuing diplomacy was the only route to bring stability to the region.","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/mpx/2704722219/2024_09/blinken-nldcnl.jpg"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57551"},"headline":"Israel says it has begun 'limited, localized and targeted' ground incursion","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57551","datePublished":"2024-09-30T23:06:49.163Z","dateModified":"2024-10-01T00:08:11.272Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Dennis Romero","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2020_03/3184066/dennis-romero-circle-byline-template.jpg","jobTitle":"Breaking News Reporter","description":"Dennis Romero is a breaking news reporter for NBC News Digital.","disambiguatingDescription":"The son of a newspaper reporter who covered the border and Mexico, and the grandson of a television journalist who announced news from a desk in Tijuana in the 1950s, I started early, covering police on a freelance basis for the border-area Star-News in Chula Vista, California, when I was in high school. I freelanced for The New York Times and the Los Angeles Times while earning a B.A. in political science at UCLA. I was a regular at Santa Monica and Beverly Hills City Council meetings for the L.A. Times and — after an arts beat internship there — I stuck around during my senior year and successfully begged to be deployed during the Los Angeles riots. I ended up as a minor part of the team that won a Pulitzer Prize for breaking news coverage. I went to The Philadelphia Inquirer after school and soon returned to the Times as a staff writer specializing in youth culture and pop music. I worked as a staff writer at two magazines before settling in at LA Weekly as a daily news reporter for eight years. My career at NBC News started in 2018.","award":" ","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/dennis-romero-ncpn856406","sameAs":["https://www.instagram.com/drjournalist","https://x.com/dennisjromero","https://www.youtube.com/user/dennisjromero"]}],"articleBody":"Israel Defense Forces troops have begun a ground incursion into Lebanon, Israel said, adding that the operation will be limited in scope.\n\n\"A few hours ago, the IDF began limited, localized, and targeted ground raids based on precise intelligence against Hezbollah terrorist targets and infrastructure in southern Lebanon,\" the IDF said in a statement.\n\nThe declaration of a limited mission comes amid fear of a full-on regional war. Hezbollah militants, who energized their attacks on Israel after Hamas militants' Oct. 7 terrorist attack on the country, are backed by Iran.\n\nThe IDF said the incursion is meant to protect Israeli citizens who live along the border with Lebanon.\n\nRead the full story here. ","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/mpx/2704722219/2024_09/1727738498162_nn_ren_Israel_Lebanon_240930_1920x1080-jng383.jpg"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57546"},"headline":"Israel's ground incursion into Lebanon appears to have begun, U.S. officials say ","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57546","datePublished":"2024-09-30T22:29:10.832Z","dateModified":"2024-10-01T00:08:43.530Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Courtney Kube","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2025_26/3694246/250624-courtney-kube.jpg","description":"Courtney Kube is a correspondent covering national security and the military for the NBC News Investigative Unit.","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/courtney-kube-ncpn3621","sameAs":["https://x.com/ckubeNBC"]},{"@type":"Person","name":"Carol E. Lee","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2020_02/3181656/carol-lee-circle-byline-template.jpg","description":"Carol E. Lee is the Washington managing editor.","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/carol-e-lee-ncpn788956","sameAs":["https://x.com/carolelee"]}],"articleBody":"Israeli officials notified the U.S. that it planned to begin a ground incursion into Lebanon that would be limited in scope, scale and duration, and two U.S. officials told NBC News that the operation appears to have begun. \n\nThe officials said the U.S. does not have independent confirmation, but the timing tracks with what the Israelis notified the U.S. it had planned.   \n\nThe officials said the U.S. has not seen any movement of assets or equipment in Iran to indicate that a response from Tehran is imminent, but Iran has been postured to move quickly if it decides to do so. \n\nIran has signaled to the U.S. that it still does not want a wider war, the officials said.","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/mpx/2704722219/2024_09/1727736491100_now_hallie_lebanon_israeli_groundinc_240930_1920x1080-d9o77m.jpg"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57540"},"headline":"U.K. to citizens in Lebanon: It is vital that you leave now","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57540","datePublished":"2024-09-30T22:12:04.689Z","dateModified":"2024-10-01T00:09:37.419Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Dennis Romero","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2020_03/3184066/dennis-romero-circle-byline-template.jpg","jobTitle":"Breaking News Reporter","description":"Dennis Romero is a breaking news reporter for NBC News Digital.","disambiguatingDescription":"The son of a newspaper reporter who covered the border and Mexico, and the grandson of a television journalist who announced news from a desk in Tijuana in the 1950s, I started early, covering police on a freelance basis for the border-area Star-News in Chula Vista, California, when I was in high school. I freelanced for The New York Times and the Los Angeles Times while earning a B.A. in political science at UCLA. I was a regular at Santa Monica and Beverly Hills City Council meetings for the L.A. Times and — after an arts beat internship there — I stuck around during my senior year and successfully begged to be deployed during the Los Angeles riots. I ended up as a minor part of the team that won a Pulitzer Prize for breaking news coverage. I went to The Philadelphia Inquirer after school and soon returned to the Times as a staff writer specializing in youth culture and pop music. I worked as a staff writer at two magazines before settling in at LA Weekly as a daily news reporter for eight years. My career at NBC News started in 2018.","award":" ","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/dennis-romero-ncpn856406","sameAs":["https://www.instagram.com/drjournalist","https://x.com/dennisjromero","https://www.youtube.com/user/dennisjromero"]}],"articleBody":"The U.K. urged its citizens in Lebanon to leave amid Israel's attacks on Iran-backed Hezbollah forces there.\n\n\"The situation in Lebanon is volatile and has potential to deteriorate quickly,\" Foreign Secretary David Lammy said in a statement today. \"It is vital that you leave now, as further evacuation may not be guaranteed.” \n\nThe government has chartered a flight to help British nationals, partners and dependents who want to leave Lebanon, the U.K.’s Foreign, Commonwealth, and Development Office said.\n\nThe flight was scheduled to depart Beirut-Rafic Hariri International Airport on Wednesday, with more flights possible, the office said in a statement.\n\nThe government earlier moved to increase capacity on commercial flights so citizens could leave amid the attacks.\n\nThe U.K. government, which has sent troops to the region, has called for a cease-fire, as has President Joe Biden.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57536"},"headline":"Nearly 100 killed in strikes in Lebanon in 24 hours, health officials say","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57536","datePublished":"2024-09-30T21:39:44.052Z","dateModified":"2024-10-01T00:10:07.459Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Reuters","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2024_21/3649017/reuters-live-blog-byline-image_1.jpg","description":"Reuters"}],"articleBody":"At least 95 people were killed and 172 were wounded in Israeli strikes on Lebanon’s southern regions, the eastern Bekaa Valley and Beirut in the past 24 hours, Lebanon’s health ministry said just after midnight in Lebanon. \n\nThe vast majority were killed in the south, with 23 killed in the east and four in Beirut.\n\nAccording to Lebanese government daily figures, 1,745 people have been killed and 8,767 have been wounded since cross-border fighting began nearly a year ago.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57538"},"headline":"Large blasts sound in southern Beirut from Israeli strike  ","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57538","datePublished":"2024-09-30T21:32:29.919Z","dateModified":"2024-10-01T00:10:36.985Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Reuters","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2024_21/3649017/reuters-live-blog-byline-image_1.jpg","description":"Reuters"}],"articleBody":"Huge consecutive blasts were heard across the Lebanese capital just after midnight local time, Reuters witnesses said, as the Israeli military carried out strikes on the city’s southern suburbs.\n\nA massive smoke cloud could be seen in a Reuters live broadcast.\n\nThe Israeli military had warned an hour earlier that it would strike specific buildings in the typically densely populated southern suburbs, saying Hezbollah was using them and telling residents to leave.\n\nMany residents had fled in recent days after a spike in Israeli strikes but ended up sleeping in the streets of the city as shelters were full.\n\nFamilies told Reuters they had struggled to find taxis to get them out of the district fast enough.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57527"},"headline":"Families take shelter by seaside in Beirut","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57527","datePublished":"2024-09-30T20:53:39.016Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T20:57:51.458Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Matt Nighswander","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2019_28/2925631/190619-matt_nighswander-byline2590.jpg","description":"Matt Nighswander is a Senior Photo Editor at NBC News Digital."}],"articleBody":"Families sleep on Beirut's corniche, a seaside promenade, after fleeing the Israeli airstrikes in the city's southern suburbs.","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2024-09/240931-lebanon-beirut-mn-1620-17ea22.jpg"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57526"},"headline":"IDF orders immediate evacuations of civilians in southern Beirut","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57526","datePublished":"2024-09-30T20:25:47.880Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T20:25:47.880Z","author":[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com"}],"articleBody":"The Israel Defense Forces ordered the immediate evacuations of civilians from their homes in parts of southern Beirut.\n\nThe military shared pictures indicating particular buildings in the suburbs of Laylaki, Haret Hreik and Burj Al-Barajneh and ordered residents to leave.\n\n\"You are located near interests and facilities belonging to the terrorist Hezbollah, and therefore the IDF will act against them forcefully,\" IDF spokesperson Avichay Adraee said on X. \"For your safety and the safety of your family, you must evacuate the buildings immediately, starting at a distance of no less than 500 meters.\"","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57517"},"headline":"Displaced people fleeing southern Lebanon take shelter in parking lot ","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57517","datePublished":"2024-09-30T20:14:44.870Z","dateModified":"2024-10-01T00:11:30.542Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Camille Behnke","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2026_05/3718042/250128_1x1_nbc_headshots_cammie_behnke_5722.jpg","description":"Camille Behnke is duty producer for NBC News based in London."},{"@type":"Person","name":"Mirna Alsharif","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2022_46/3581066/mirna-alsharif-byline-jm.jpg","jobTitle":"Reporter, Breaking News","description":"Mirna Alsharif is a breaking news reporter for NBC News.","disambiguatingDescription":"Prior to  NBC News, I wrote for CNN where I covered some of the biggest stories of the past five years, including the killing of George Floyd and the outset of the Covid-19 pandemic.","award":"I was a finalist for AMEJA's (Arab and Middle Eastern Journalists Association) Excellence in Reporting Awards in the category \"Best coverage of Arab and Middle Eastern heritage communities in North America.\"","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/mirna-alsharif-ncpn1297517","sameAs":["https://www.instagram.com/mirna_alsharif","https://x.com/mirna_alsharif"]}],"articleBody":"Lebanese civilians fleeing Israeli airstrikes in southern Lebanon took refuge in a parking lot in the coastal town of Sidon.\n\nScores of families could be seen sitting on the floor, with bedding nearby. Drying laundry hung on a fence surrounding the parking lot. \n\n\"We have many needs,\" a man carrying an infant told an NBC News crew. \"The most important one is shelter for the children.\"\n\nAbout 1 million people have been displaced in Lebanon as a result of the escalating conflict between Israel and Hezbollah, according to Prime Minister Najib Mikati.","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/mpx/2704722219/2024_09/f_tov_lon_sidon_displaced_240930-m6oz2m.jpg"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57515"},"headline":"IDF designates 'closed military area' in northern Israel ahead of ground operation in Lebanon","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57515","datePublished":"2024-09-30T19:45:10.266Z","dateModified":"2024-10-01T00:12:08.730Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Mirna Alsharif","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2022_46/3581066/mirna-alsharif-byline-jm.jpg","jobTitle":"Reporter, Breaking News","description":"Mirna Alsharif is a breaking news reporter for NBC News.","disambiguatingDescription":"Prior to  NBC News, I wrote for CNN where I covered some of the biggest stories of the past five years, including the killing of George Floyd and the outset of the Covid-19 pandemic.","award":"I was a finalist for AMEJA's (Arab and Middle Eastern Journalists Association) Excellence in Reporting Awards in the category \"Best coverage of Arab and Middle Eastern heritage communities in North America.\"","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/mirna-alsharif-ncpn1297517","sameAs":["https://www.instagram.com/mirna_alsharif","https://x.com/mirna_alsharif"]}],"articleBody":"The Israel Defense Forces announced the designation of \"a closed military area\" in northern Israel ahead of a possible ground operation in Lebanon.\n\nThe area consists of the town of Metula and two kibbutzim, Meshgav Am and Kfar Giladi, the IDF said on X, adding that entering the area is prohibited.\n\nA limited ground operation into Lebanon could begin as early as today, according to a U.S. official, a Biden administration official and a source familiar with the planning.","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2024-09/240930-israel-lebanon-border-tanks-se-311p-7455b2.jpg"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57501"},"headline":"Lebanese refugees cross into Iraq","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57501","datePublished":"2024-09-30T19:32:42.349Z","dateModified":"2024-10-01T00:12:35.624Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Khalid Razak","description":"Khalid Razak is a producer for NBC News based in Baghdad."}],"articleBody":"Seventeen Lebanese refugees crossed into Iraq via the Al-Qaim border between Syria and Iraq, the Iraqi Red Crescent said today. Among them was a wounded person, it added.\n\n\"The Red Crescent teams received the displaced and provided food services and first aid, especially to the wounded,\" it said in a statement. \n\nTo date, 144 Lebanese refugees have crossed into Iraq through the Al-Qaim border, the statement said. ","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57480"},"headline":"Lebanese health system overstretched, WHO warns ","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57480","datePublished":"2024-09-30T18:50:54.865Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T18:55:25.112Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Henry Austin","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2026_05/3718022/250128_1x1_nbc_headshots_henry_austin_5899.jpg","jobTitle":"Contributor","description":"Henry Austin is a senior editor for NBC News Digital based in London.","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/henry-austin-ncpn4346","sameAs":["https://x.com/henrya1"]}],"articleBody":"Lebanon’s health system remains impacted and overstretched by a new escalation of violence in the country, the World Health Organization said today  in a situation report. \n\nWarning that displaced people were at increased risk of diseases, the United Nations agency said that around 118,466 new displacements took place between Sept. 23 and 27.  \n\nIsrael continues to carry out airstrikes on targets in Beirut and elsewhere in Lebanon.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57503"},"headline":"Israeli ground operation into southern Lebanon could begin today, officials say","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57503","datePublished":"2024-09-30T18:25:13.024Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T18:38:48.670Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Raf Sanchez","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2026_05/3718031/250127_1x1_nbc_headshots_raf_sanchez_5366.jpg","description":"Raf Sanchez is a foreign correspondent for NBC News."},{"@type":"Person","name":"Carol E. Lee","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2020_02/3181656/carol-lee-circle-byline-template.jpg","description":"Carol E. Lee is the Washington managing editor.","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/carol-e-lee-ncpn788956","sameAs":["https://x.com/carolelee"]},{"@type":"Person","name":"Courtney Kube","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2025_26/3694246/250624-courtney-kube.jpg","description":"Courtney Kube is a correspondent covering national security and the military for the NBC News Investigative Unit.","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/courtney-kube-ncpn3621","sameAs":["https://x.com/ckubeNBC"]}],"articleBody":"Israel is planning a limited ground operation into Lebanon that could begin imminently, according to a U.S. official, a Biden administration official and a source familiar with the planning.\n\nIsrael informed the U.S. that the incursion into southern Lebanon could begin as early as today and that the intent is to push Hezbollah forces further away from the Israeli border and target their infrastructure, including stockpiles and weapons, the officials explained.\n\nThe offensive will be limited in duration and scope, possibly beginning as early as tonight and lasting for days, not weeks, they said, adding that the geographical reach will be limited.\n\nIsrael has begun probing operations already, the U.S. official said, including small-scale ground missions with their Special Forces. They have also deployed combat engineers and other troops for missions like breaching. The IDF currently has about five brigades forward deployed but not all of those are expected to move across the border, the official said.\n\nThe official stressed that the operation is intended to be limited in duration and scope, targeting Hezbollah stockpiles and weapons, including underground facilities.\n\nIsrael was planning for a larger invasion but after U.S. officials urged them to reconsider during extensive conversations over the weekend, they have decided to scale back, the administration and U.S. officials said.\n\nBut the Biden administration remains concerned the mission could expand, the administration official said, adding that President Joe Biden is still pushing for a cease-fire.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57486"},"headline":"Houthis say they will respond to Israel port bombing 'by escalating military operations'","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57486","datePublished":"2024-09-30T18:18:21.411Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T18:39:57.676Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Ammar Cheikh Omar","jobTitle":"Producer","description":"Ammar Cheikh Omar is a producer for NBC News."},{"@type":"Person","name":"Mirna Alsharif","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2022_46/3581066/mirna-alsharif-byline-jm.jpg","jobTitle":"Reporter, Breaking News","description":"Mirna Alsharif is a breaking news reporter for NBC News.","disambiguatingDescription":"Prior to  NBC News, I wrote for CNN where I covered some of the biggest stories of the past five years, including the killing of George Floyd and the outset of the Covid-19 pandemic.","award":"I was a finalist for AMEJA's (Arab and Middle Eastern Journalists Association) Excellence in Reporting Awards in the category \"Best coverage of Arab and Middle Eastern heritage communities in North America.\"","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/mirna-alsharif-ncpn1297517","sameAs":["https://www.instagram.com/mirna_alsharif","https://x.com/mirna_alsharif"]}],"articleBody":"The Israeli attack on Al Hudaydah “will not deter the Yemeni people and their armed forces from performing their religious, humanitarian and moral duty towards the Palestinian and Lebanese peoples,” the statement said. \n\nThe IDF said it was targeting Houthi infrastructure to prevent the group’s ability to obtain supplies from Iran.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57491"},"headline":"Displaced families crowd Beirut streets as fears of Israeli invasion grow ","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57491","datePublished":"2024-09-30T18:00:56.869Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T18:41:48.993Z","author":[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com"}],"articleBody":"Families fleeing Israeli airstrikes in southern Lebanon and other areas that have been attacked are flocking to Martyr’s Square in Beirut. \n\nNBC News’ chief foreign correspondent Richard Engel reports that many there fear what happened in Gaza will happen to them as well.","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/mpx/2704722219/2024_09/1727714225547_n_mitchell_brk_lebanon_invasion_fears_240930_1920x1080-q55sqq.jpg"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57494"},"headline":"Israel informed U.S. of plans for limited operations in Lebanon, State Department says","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57494","datePublished":"2024-09-30T17:52:40.623Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T18:43:30.329Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Abigail Williams","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2020_02/3181676/abigail-williams-circle-byline-template.jpg","jobTitle":"Associate Producer","description":"Abigail Williams is a producer and reporter for NBC News covering the State Department."},{"@type":"Person","name":"Mirna Alsharif","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2022_46/3581066/mirna-alsharif-byline-jm.jpg","jobTitle":"Reporter, Breaking News","description":"Mirna Alsharif is a breaking news reporter for NBC News.","disambiguatingDescription":"Prior to  NBC News, I wrote for CNN where I covered some of the biggest stories of the past five years, including the killing of George Floyd and the outset of the Covid-19 pandemic.","award":"I was a finalist for AMEJA's (Arab and Middle Eastern Journalists Association) Excellence in Reporting Awards in the category \"Best coverage of Arab and Middle Eastern heritage communities in North America.\"","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/mirna-alsharif-ncpn1297517","sameAs":["https://www.instagram.com/mirna_alsharif","https://x.com/mirna_alsharif"]}],"articleBody":"Israel has informed the U.S. of their plans for limited ground operations in Lebanon focusing on infrastructure belonging to the Hezbollah militant group,  State Department spokesperson Matthew Miller said today.  \n\n“They have at this time, told us that those are limited operations focused on Hezbollah, infrastructure, near the border but we’re in continuous conversations,” Miller told reporters at a briefing.\n\nIsrael and Hezbollah have been trading fire across Lebanon's southern border since Oct. 8, the day after Hamas launched its cross-border terror attacks on Israel.  \n\nEarlier in the day, Israel's defense minister said \"the next phase in the war against Hezbollah will begin soon,” adding that the goal was to return residents of north Israel to their homes. However, Yoav Gallant did not elaborate on what this new phase would entail. ","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57493"},"headline":"Israel's security cabinet to meet as ground offensive looms","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57493","datePublished":"2024-09-30T17:25:14.303Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T18:44:00.237Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Raf Sanchez","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2026_05/3718031/250127_1x1_nbc_headshots_raf_sanchez_5366.jpg","description":"Raf Sanchez is a foreign correspondent for NBC News."}],"articleBody":"Israel's security cabinet will meet at 9 p.m. local time (2 p.m. ET) amid growing indications an Israeli ground offensive into southern Lebanon may be imminent, an Israeli official told NBC News today.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57489"},"headline":"E.U. foreign ministers hold emergency meeting on Lebanon escalation ","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57489","datePublished":"2024-09-30T17:16:56.879Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T18:52:52.234Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Mirna Alsharif","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2022_46/3581066/mirna-alsharif-byline-jm.jpg","jobTitle":"Reporter, Breaking News","description":"Mirna Alsharif is a breaking news reporter for NBC News.","disambiguatingDescription":"Prior to  NBC News, I wrote for CNN where I covered some of the biggest stories of the past five years, including the killing of George Floyd and the outset of the Covid-19 pandemic.","award":"I was a finalist for AMEJA's (Arab and Middle Eastern Journalists Association) Excellence in Reporting Awards in the category \"Best coverage of Arab and Middle Eastern heritage communities in North America.\"","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/mirna-alsharif-ncpn1297517","sameAs":["https://www.instagram.com/mirna_alsharif","https://x.com/mirna_alsharif"]}],"articleBody":"Foreign ministers from the European Union held an emergency meeting on Lebanon today, according to Peter Stano, lead spokesperson for the external affairs of the E.U.\n\nThe high representative of the union will give a statement shortly, Stano said. \n\nThe gathering comes days after the E.U. said that it would provide 10 million euros ($11.1 million) in aid for people in Lebanon affected by the “ongoing escalation of hostilities” between Israel and Hezbollah.\n\n“This emergency funding aims to tackle the most urgent needs such as protection, food assistance, shelter and health care,” a statement from the E.U. said Saturday. “The E.U. stands ready to provide further support by mobilising all the available emergency response tools, including via use of the Civil Protection Mechanism.\n\n“People in Lebanon, including refugees, were already experiencing high levels of poverty and food insecurity while having limited access to services,” the E.U. added. “Nearly 2 million Lebanese and Syrian refugees are estimated to be food insecure. This number is expected to rise further.”","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57485"},"headline":"Israeli defense minister says 'next phase in the war against Hezbollah will begin soon'","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57485","datePublished":"2024-09-30T16:53:17.672Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T17:01:12.416Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Mirna Alsharif","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2022_46/3581066/mirna-alsharif-byline-jm.jpg","jobTitle":"Reporter, Breaking News","description":"Mirna Alsharif is a breaking news reporter for NBC News.","disambiguatingDescription":"Prior to  NBC News, I wrote for CNN where I covered some of the biggest stories of the past five years, including the killing of George Floyd and the outset of the Covid-19 pandemic.","award":"I was a finalist for AMEJA's (Arab and Middle Eastern Journalists Association) Excellence in Reporting Awards in the category \"Best coverage of Arab and Middle Eastern heritage communities in North America.\"","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/mirna-alsharif-ncpn1297517","sameAs":["https://www.instagram.com/mirna_alsharif","https://x.com/mirna_alsharif"]}],"articleBody":"The “next phase in the war against Hezbollah will begin soon,” Israel's defense minister said in a post on X today. \n\nYoav Gallant said the phase \"will be a significant factor in achieving the goal of the war — returning the residents of the north to their homes.\"\n\nHe did not say what this phase would entail. ","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2024-09/240930-northern-israel-mn-1300-2d7142.jpg"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57483"},"headline":"IDF soldier 'severely injured' during combat in southern Gaza","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57483","datePublished":"2024-09-30T16:45:46.250Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T16:45:46.250Z","author":[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com"}],"articleBody":"An Israel Defense Forces soldier was “severely injured” during combat in southern Gaza, the military said in a statement today. \n\nThe soldier is from the 8108th battalion of the 679th brigade, the IDF said. The soldier was not named and the extent of the injuries are not known. \n\n“The soldier was evacuated to a hospital for further treatment, his family was notified,” the statement added.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57446"},"headline":"Lebanese PM ready to send army south of Litani River","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57446","datePublished":"2024-09-30T16:35:08.261Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T16:35:08.261Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Freddie Clayton","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2026_05/3717929/250127_1x1_nbc_headshots_freddie_clayton_5339.jpg","description":"Freddie Clayton is a freelance journalist based in London. "},{"@type":"Person","name":"Ammar Cheikh Omar","jobTitle":"Producer","description":"Ammar Cheikh Omar is a producer for NBC News."}],"articleBody":"Lebanon is ready to send its army south of the Litani river, the nation’s Prime Minister Najib Mikati told reporters today.\n\nMikati said his government was “ready to implement the 1701 agreement,” referencing a 2006 U.N. resolution that aimed to end Hezbollah’s armed presence in the south as part of an agreement to end a 34-day war with Israel.\n\nThe resolution also called for a full Israeli withdrawal from southern Lebanon. The Litani river lies about 20 miles from Lebanon’s southern border.\n\n“We confirm our agreement and pledge to implement the ceasefire immediately to discuss the implementation of U.N. Resolution 1701,” said Mikati. ","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57477"},"headline":"UNRWA chief denies knowledge that suspended employee was Hamas leader in Lebanon  ","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57477","datePublished":"2024-09-30T16:03:33.872Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T16:05:40.351Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Reuters","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2024_21/3649017/reuters-live-blog-byline-image_1.jpg","description":"Reuters"}],"articleBody":"The U.N. Palestinian refugee agency (UNRWA) chief today denied knowing that its employee Fateh Sherif Abu el-Amin was a Hamas commander in Lebanon and called on states to push back against Israeli attacks on the agency.\n\nThe head of Hamas’ Lebanon branch, Abu el-Amin was killed along with family members in an Israeli strike in southern Lebanon, the group said today. He was suspended from his job at UNRWA in March following allegations concerning his politics, Philippe Lazzarini told reporters in Geneva.\n\n“I never heard the word commander before,” he said. “What’s obvious for you today, was not obvious yesterday.” ","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57470"},"headline":"'We should have a cease-fire right now,' Biden says","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57470","datePublished":"2024-09-30T16:00:29.981Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T17:17:43.588Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Sarah Dean","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2024_31/3656901/240729-sarah-dean.jpg","description":"Sarah Dean is a White House Producer for NBC News.","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/sarah-dean-ncpn1281478"}],"articleBody":"There should be a cease-fire “right now,” President Joe Biden said today when asked whether he was comfortable with Israel’s plan to invade Lebanon in its fight against Hezbollah.  \n\n“I’m more aware than you might know and I’m comfortable with them stopping,” he told reporters at the White House. “We should have a cease-fire right now.”","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2024-09/240930-lebanon-mn-1300-770dcb.jpg"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57475"},"headline":"Hezbollah fires Nour missile into northern Israel ","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57475","datePublished":"2024-09-30T15:52:05.783Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T15:59:23.626Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Ammar Cheikh Omar","jobTitle":"Producer","description":"Ammar Cheikh Omar is a producer for NBC News."},{"@type":"Person","name":"Reuters","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2024_21/3649017/reuters-live-blog-byline-image_1.jpg","description":"Reuters"}],"articleBody":"Hezbollah said in a statement that it fired a Nour missile at Israel, which sources familiar with the Lebanese militant group told Reuters is a ballistic missile. \n\nThe missile hit the village of Kafr Giladi in northern Israel, the statement said, adding that it had fired it in response to “Israeli violations of cities, villages, and civilians.” \n\n It was the first time they have used the missile, the statement said. ","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57471"},"headline":"Iran has 'no good options' to retaliate against Israel, leading analyst concludes","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57471","datePublished":"2024-09-30T15:41:12.888Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T16:00:23.116Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Ian Sherwood","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2024_32/3658445/240730-ian_sherwood.jpg","description":"Ian Sherwood is an Executive Editor for NBC News overseeing Richard Engel’s editorial team.","sameAs":["https://x.com/IanJSherwood"]}],"articleBody":"Iran faces “no good options in retaliting against Israel,” following the assassination of Hezbollah leader Hassan Nasrallah, according to a senior research fellow at the Royal United Services Institute, a London based think tank. \n\nBurcu Ozcelik said in a commentary that Iran could “mobilize militia in Iraq and Syria against Israeli, U.S. and U.K. targets, but refrain from direct confrontation.” \n\nShe added that Iran could mobilize attacks from the Yemen-based Houthi militia “against sensitive targets inside Israel.\"\n\n“With Hezbollah now in crisis, the Houthis may gain more operational significance. An escalation in Houthi-led harassment and attacks on commercial shipping in the Red Sea may be expected,” she said. Tehran also backs the Houthis. \n\nThird, she said, Iran could attack Israel directly which “may salvage Iran’s credibility with its core base” inside the country but could erode the country’s “projection of military strength and cause a legitimacy crisis inside Iran.”   \n\n“If a negotiated ceasefire in Gaza was not enough of a priority before, it is even more important now. It may now be the crucial lever needed to initiate a process of de-escalation,\" she said. ","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57460"},"headline":"Islamic Resistance in Iraq claims two strikes on Haifa","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57460","datePublished":"2024-09-30T14:59:25.364Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T14:59:25.364Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Freddie Clayton","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2026_05/3717929/250127_1x1_nbc_headshots_freddie_clayton_5339.jpg","description":"Freddie Clayton is a freelance journalist based in London. "},{"@type":"Person","name":"Ammar Cheikh Omar","jobTitle":"Producer","description":"Ammar Cheikh Omar is a producer for NBC News."}],"articleBody":"The Islamic Resistance in Iraq said in a statement today that it attacked four Israeli targets in response to Israel's attacks on Lebanon and Gaza.\n\nIt said that it attacked two “vital” targets in the Israeli port city of Haifa using drones, as well as two other unspecified targets.\n\nNBC News has reached out to the IDF for comment. ","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57463"},"headline":"Germany flies embassy employee families and non-essential embassy personnel out of the region","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57463","datePublished":"2024-09-30T14:45:07.997Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T14:45:07.997Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Carlo Angerer","jobTitle":"Producer","description":"Carlo Angerer is a multimedia producer and reporter based in Mainz, Germany. ","sameAs":["https://www.facebook.com/carloangerer","https://www.instagram.com/carloangerer","https://x.com/carloangerer"]}],"articleBody":"Germany has started to fly non-essential personnel and the family members of embassy employees out of Israel, Lebanon and the occupied West Bank, the country's foreign office said in a statement today.   \n\n\"In view of the situation, the Federal Foreign Office raised the crisis level for the foreign missions in Beirut, Ramallah and Tel Aviv again at the weekend and initiated a diplomatic pick-up,\" the statement said. \n\n\"This means that the embassies remain operational, but family members of the posted employees and of German intermediary organizations as well as non-essential personnel are flying out,\" it added. \n\n“The embassy continues to support the remaining Germans in Lebanon in their departure via commercial flights and other means,” it said.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57465"},"headline":"Netanyahu says nowhere in Middle East out of Israel’s reach","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57465","datePublished":"2024-09-30T14:38:15.321Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T15:17:21.006Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"F. Brinley Bruton ","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2026_05/3718021/250127_1x1_nbc_headshots_brinley_bruton_5536.jpg","jobTitle":"Editor and Senior writer - London","description":"F. Brinley Bruton is Assistant Managing Editor for International News, NBC News Digital. ","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/f-brinley-bruton-ncpn721","sameAs":["https://x.com/BrinleyBruton"]}],"articleBody":"There is nowhere in the Middle East that Israel cannot reach, Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu warned today in comments directed at Iran, two days after Israel killed the leader of Tehran-backed Lebanese militant group Hezbollah.\n\nSpeaking in English in a three-minute video clip released by his office, Netanyahu said he was addressing “the people of Iran.”\n\n“There is nowhere in the Middle East Israel cannot reach.  There is nowhere we will not go to protect our people and protect our country,” Netanyahu said. \n\n“Don’t let a small group of fanatic theocrats crush your hopes and your dreams,” he added. “You deserve better.”","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57457"},"headline":"Bahrain’s king urges preservation of Lebanon's sovereignty ","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57457","datePublished":"2024-09-30T14:24:55.312Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T14:49:23.772Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Freddie Clayton","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2026_05/3717929/250127_1x1_nbc_headshots_freddie_clayton_5339.jpg","description":"Freddie Clayton is a freelance journalist based in London. "}],"articleBody":"Bahrain’s King Hamad bin Isa Al Khalifa said today that it was important to preserve Lebanon’s sovereignty and revive efforts to reach a cease-fire in Gaza.\n\nBahrain is home to the U.S. Navy 5th Fleet and has close ties to the U.S. It has long blamed Iran, a Muslim Shia nation, for stirring up its own majority Shia population against its Sunni monarchy. ","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57454"},"headline":"U.S. Embassy working with airlines in Lebanon","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57454","datePublished":"2024-09-30T13:51:41.214Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T13:51:41.214Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Freddie Clayton","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2026_05/3717929/250127_1x1_nbc_headshots_freddie_clayton_5339.jpg","description":"Freddie Clayton is a freelance journalist based in London. "}],"articleBody":"The U.S. Embassy in Beirut said it is working with airlines to help citizens depart Lebanon by providing additional flights. \n\nMany airlines have stopped flying to Lebanon since Israel intensified its offensive in the past fortnight.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57443"},"headline":"Russia warns of 'very high' risk of regional war ","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57443","datePublished":"2024-09-30T13:40:20.011Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T13:40:20.011Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Freddie Clayton","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2026_05/3717929/250127_1x1_nbc_headshots_freddie_clayton_5339.jpg","description":"Freddie Clayton is a freelance journalist based in London. "}],"articleBody":"The risk of a major war in the Middle East is “very high,” following the death of Hezbollah leader Hassan Nasrallah, Kremlin spokesman Dmitry Peskov told reporters today. \n\nCondemning Nasrallah’s death, Peskov said Russia believed it had “significantly destabilized the situation in the region.”\n\n“Such indiscriminate bombings of residential areas in Lebanon lead to a huge amount of victims and will inevitably result in a humanitarian disaster, the same as we see in Gaza,” he said. \n\n“We cannot ignore such consequences and we cannot help being deeply concerned over them,” he added.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57419"},"headline":"Satellite images show craters left by Israeli airstrike on Nasrallah's bunker","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57419","datePublished":"2024-09-30T13:20:06.944Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T13:24:12.081Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Will Clark","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2024_32/3658449/240730-will-clark.jpg","description":"Will Clark is a freelance photo and video editor for NBC News based in London."}],"articleBody":"Satellite images taken Aug. 25 and yesterday show the area of southern Beirut where Hezbollah leader Hassan Nasrallah was killed by an Israeli airstrike.","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-before-after-wc-0922-f5e0cd.jpg"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57440"},"headline":"Goal is safe return of northern communities, Israeli defense minister says","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57440","datePublished":"2024-09-30T13:00:26.305Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T13:28:42.539Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Yarden Segev","description":"Yarden Segev is a news coordinater for NBC News based in Israel."}],"articleBody":"Israel is prepared to “make every effort necessary” in order to ensure the return of its northern communities, the country's defense minister said today on a visit to the border with Lebanon.  \n\n“Our goal is to ensure the [safe] return of Israel’s northern communities to their homes,” Yoav Gallant was quoted as saying in a statement. “We will use all the means that may be required — your forces, other forces, from the air, from the sea, and on land.”\n\nThe statement said Gallant was briefed about the readiness of troops for the possibility of expanding activities in the north.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57449"},"headline":"Soldier killed by Israeli drone, Lebanese army says ","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57449","datePublished":"2024-09-30T12:38:44.458Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T12:51:04.071Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Ammar Cheikh Omar","jobTitle":"Producer","description":"Ammar Cheikh Omar is a producer for NBC News."},{"@type":"Person","name":"Freddie Clayton","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2026_05/3717929/250127_1x1_nbc_headshots_freddie_clayton_5339.jpg","description":"Freddie Clayton is a freelance journalist based in London. "}],"articleBody":"A Lebanese soldier was killed by an Israeli drone, the country's army said today in a post on X. \n\nThe drone targeted a motorcycle while it was passing through an army checkpoint, the post said. ","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57422"},"headline":"100,000 have fled Lebanon for Syria, U.N. says ","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57422","datePublished":"2024-09-30T12:33:45.851Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T12:33:45.851Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Freddie Clayton","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2026_05/3717929/250127_1x1_nbc_headshots_freddie_clayton_5339.jpg","description":"Freddie Clayton is a freelance journalist based in London. "}],"articleBody":"More than 100,000 Lebanese nationals and Syrians living in Lebanon have crossed into Syria as they flee Israeli airstrikes, the United Nations High Commissioner for Refugees said today. \n\nFilippo Grandi said in a post on X that the U.N. Relief and Works Agency is present at four crossing points alongside local authorities and the Syrian Red Crescent to support new arrivals.\n\nSeparately, the U.N. Relief and Works Agency, known as UNRWA, said 1,424 people, almost half of them children, are registered at its emergency shelters in Lebanon.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57423"},"headline":"Beirut strike shows 'no safe place' in Lebanon, aid worker says ","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57423","datePublished":"2024-09-30T12:00:54.315Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T12:52:27.908Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Chantal Da Silva","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2024_32/3658438/240730-chantal-da-silva.jpg","description":"Chantal Da Silva reports on world news for NBC News Digital and is based in London.","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/chantal-da-silva-ncpn1269216"}],"articleBody":"Fears are growing that “no one is safe” in Lebanon after Israel’s airstrike in central Beirut, according to the executive director of a humanitarian nongovernmental organization working to support families displaced by the bombing campaign. \n\nHumanitarian workers were “shocked” by the strike in Beirut’s Cola district, Jihan Kaisi, the Executive Director of the Union of Relief and Development Associations, or URDA, told NBC News.  \n\n“This Cola area is crowded with families, with displaced families, who came to this area thinking it’s safe,” she said. “It’s a very crowded area.” And the strike targeting the area, just a couple of miles from downtown Beirut and the city’s Zaitunay Bay, she said, showed there was “no safe place guaranteed in Lebanon.” \n\nShe added that a deadly strike in the Sidon or Saida area in southern Lebanon on Sunday, had also heightened fears in that part of the country.  \n\nThousands of families have been sheltering there under the belief that the heavily populated area would be safe and now they don’t know where else to go, she said.  \n\nSome families have been forced to sleep on the streets, in playgrounds and in parking lots after makeshift shelters set up in schools became too overcrowded, she added. \n\n“It’s getting cold at night,” she said. “Imagine, children without any blanket at night. Imagine what is happening... what they will go through.” \n\nShe said many people had expressed fears that Lebanon could soon become like Gaza. “There’s talk that Lebanon might face the same situation,” she said. “So, yes they are talking about that. Families are scared.”","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57416"},"headline":"'Stay alert, Stay ready,' IDF warns people in northern Israel","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57416","datePublished":"2024-09-30T11:46:13.713Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T12:15:09.544Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Yarden Segev","description":"Yarden Segev is a news coordinater for NBC News based in Israel."}],"articleBody":"People should be ready to seek shelter because Israel’s air defense is “not impenetrable,” according to the Commanding Officer of the Home Front Command in Northern Israel.   \n\n“When you hear an alert, immediately enter a sheltered space,” Rafi Milo said on a visit to the region last night. “If you don’t have access to a sheltered space, choose the safest space available and enter it — this saves lives. Stay alert, stay ready, and follow the instructions.”","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57415"},"headline":"French foreign minister travels to Beirut after two nationals killed","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57415","datePublished":"2024-09-30T11:31:17.799Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T12:53:39.528Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Freddie Clayton","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2026_05/3717929/250127_1x1_nbc_headshots_freddie_clayton_5339.jpg","description":"Freddie Clayton is a freelance journalist based in London. "}],"articleBody":"French Foreign Minister Jean-Noel Barrot called for an “immediate” end to Israeli airstrikes after he arrived in Lebanon yesterday with a delivery of humanitarian aid.\n\n“We will always stand by the civilians,” he said in a post on X, adding that he had brought 12 tons of medical equipment to be used to treat 1,000 seriously injured people.\n\nAs Barrot arrived, his ministry announced that a second French person had been killed in Lebanon. It did not provide further details. \n\nLast week, an 87-year-old Frenchwoman was killed after “a strong explosion” in the south of the country.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57427"},"headline":"Nasrallah killing was Israeli self-defense, Germany says","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57427","datePublished":"2024-09-30T11:16:50.514Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T12:54:07.207Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Reuters","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2024_21/3649017/reuters-live-blog-byline-image_1.jpg","description":"Reuters"}],"articleBody":"Israel’s killing of Hezbollah leader Sayyed Hassan Nasrallah in a powerful airstrike in Beirut constituted a use of its right to defend itself, a German foreign ministry spokesperson said today.\n\n“Hezbollah is of course a terrorist organization and it was obviously a meeting of the top leadership of Hezbollah, from which one can assume, even from a distance, that they were planning their further operations,” the spokesperson said.\n\n“So in this respect, there are also reasons to believe that the right to self-defense was exercised here,” he added.\n\nAsked about the civilian deaths in the incident, the spokesperson said “every civilian victim is one civilian victim too many.”","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57432"},"headline":"Israeli special forces teams carrying out operations in Lebanon ","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57432","datePublished":"2024-09-30T10:55:16.639Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T10:55:16.639Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Raf Sanchez","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2026_05/3718031/250127_1x1_nbc_headshots_raf_sanchez_5366.jpg","description":"Raf Sanchez is a foreign correspondent for NBC News."}],"articleBody":"Israel has been launching small special forces operations into southern Lebanon ahead of a potential ground offensive, an Israeli official told NBC News. \n\nThe operations are designed to gather intelligence and probe Hezbollah’s positions. The official cautioned that such operations have been going on for months and do not necessarily signal the imminent start of a ground assault","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57424"},"headline":"Hezbollah says it is ready for 'ground encounter'  ","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57424","datePublished":"2024-09-30T10:53:29.006Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T12:55:08.714Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Freddie Clayton","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2026_05/3717929/250127_1x1_nbc_headshots_freddie_clayton_5339.jpg","description":"Freddie Clayton is a freelance journalist based in London. "},{"@type":"Person","name":"Ammar Cheikh Omar","jobTitle":"Producer","description":"Ammar Cheikh Omar is a producer for NBC News."}],"articleBody":"The deputy secretary general of Hezbollah, Naim Qassem, said the militant group is \"ready for the enemy to enter by land\" during a pre-recorded message televised today.\n\nQassem said that Hezbollah would \"not budge an inch\" in supporting Gaza and Palestine, and that the group would emerge victorious \"just as we did in 2006,\" recalling the 34-day conflict between Israel and Hezbollah. \n\nIt’s the first major public comment from Hezbollah since its leader Hassan Nasrallah was killed by an Israeli airstrike in Beirut last week. \n\nQassem said the group will choose Nasrallah's replacement \"as soon as possible.\"","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2024-09/240930-hezbollah-address-wc-1142-153641.jpg"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57425"},"headline":"Israel confirms it killed Hamas leader in Lebanon","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57425","datePublished":"2024-09-30T10:27:48.404Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T13:28:09.882Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Freddie Clayton","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2026_05/3717929/250127_1x1_nbc_headshots_freddie_clayton_5339.jpg","description":"Freddie Clayton is a freelance journalist based in London. "},{"@type":"Person","name":"Yarden Segev","description":"Yarden Segev is a news coordinater for NBC News based in Israel."}],"articleBody":"The IDF and Israel Security Agency issued a joint statement today saying they had killed Hamas' leader in Lebanon, Fateh Sherif Abu Al-Amin.\n\nThe statement said the Israeli air forces struck Al-Amin overnight.\n\nEarlier, Hamas said the leader and his family were killed in an Israeli airstrike at their home in southern Lebanon.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57413"},"headline":"Photos show aftermath of Israeli airstrike in Beirut's southern suburbs","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57413","datePublished":"2024-09-30T10:21:00.911Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T12:56:06.704Z","author":[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com"}],"articleBody":"Photos show the damage to an apartment building in Beirut's southern suburb of Ghobeiry after an overnight Israeli airstrike targeted the area today.","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2024-09/240930-lebanon-strike-ghobeiry-wc-0837-edb70d.jpg"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57421"},"headline":"Iran will not leave Israel’s ‘criminal acts’ unanswered, says foreign ministry ","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57421","datePublished":"2024-09-30T09:04:14.812Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T09:29:24.592Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Reuters","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2024_21/3649017/reuters-live-blog-byline-image_1.jpg","description":"Reuters"}],"articleBody":"Iran will not leave any of “the criminal acts” of Israel unanswered, Iranian Foreign Ministry spokesperson Nasser Kanaani said this morning, after the killing of Hezbollah’s chief and an Iranian Revolutionary Guard deputy commander in Lebanon.\n\nBrigadier General Abbas Nilforoushan was also killed in Israeli strikes on Beirut on Friday.\n\n“We stand strongly and we will act in a way that is regretful [for the enemy],” Kanaani told a weekly news conference, adding that Iran does not seek war but is not afraid of it.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57418"},"headline":"Senior Hezbollah official to give first speech since Nasrallah killing","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57418","datePublished":"2024-09-30T08:38:13.532Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T09:29:54.793Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Freddie Clayton","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2026_05/3717929/250127_1x1_nbc_headshots_freddie_clayton_5339.jpg","description":"Freddie Clayton is a freelance journalist based in London. "}],"articleBody":"The deputy secretary general of Hezbollah, Naem Qassem, is set to make a speech shortly.\n\nIt's the first major public comment from the militant group since the killing of former longtime leader Hassan Nasrallah in an Israeli attack. The Iran-backed group has yet to announce his replacement. ","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57411"},"headline":"PFLP says three leaders killed in Israeli strike","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57411","datePublished":"2024-09-30T08:21:00.473Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T12:57:13.852Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Freddie Clayton","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2026_05/3717929/250127_1x1_nbc_headshots_freddie_clayton_5339.jpg","description":"Freddie Clayton is a freelance journalist based in London. "},{"@type":"Person","name":"Ammar Cheikh Omar","jobTitle":"Producer","description":"Ammar Cheikh Omar is a producer for NBC News."}],"articleBody":"The Popular Front for the Liberation of Palestine has said that three of its leaders were killed in an Israeli airstrike on central Beirut's Cola district.\n\nIt listed Mohammed Abdel Aal, Emad Odeh, and Abdel Rahman Abdel Aal among the deceased.\n\nThe leftist PFLP is designated a terrorist group by the U.S., but it is also a member of the Palestine Liberation Organization, a coalition recognized by the United Nations as the official representative of the Palestinians.  \n\nIsraeli officials are yet to comment on the strike on the Cola district.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57409"},"headline":"Apparent Israeli strike hits central Beirut for first time","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57409","datePublished":"2024-09-30T08:12:18.200Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T12:56:51.903Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Rudy Chinchilla","description":"Rudy Chinchilla is a breaking news editor for NBC News Digital.","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/rudy-chinchilla-ncpn1263830"},{"@type":"Person","name":"Doha Madani","jobTitle":"Senior Breaking News Reporter","description":"Doha Madani is a senior breaking news reporter for NBC News. Pronouns: she/her.","disambiguatingDescription":"I did my undergraduate studies in government and journalism at the University of Tampa before obtaining a master's degree in international reporting at the CUNY Graduate School of Journalism. My byline has appeared at the Tampa Tribune, Lebanon's The Daily Star, and HuffPost. While at NBC News I've had the privilege of covering some of our biggest stories including the pandemic, the Depp-Heard trial, the Supreme Court's Dobbs decision, and the Israel-Hamas war. ","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/doha-madani-ncpn915866","sameAs":["https://x.com/dohamadani"]}],"articleBody":"An apparent Israeli airstrike struck a building in the central Beirut neighborhood of Cola last night, according to videos posted to social media.\n\nThe videos, geolocated by NBC News, show damage to the multistory building as debris is seen on the ground below. People are also seen gathering around the structure as multiple ambulances converge on the area.\n\nIt was not immediately clear whether there were deaths or injuries related to the reported strike, nor was it clear that the strike was intentionally aimed at Cola.\n\nCola, a stone’s throw from downtown Beirut, is known as a busy neighborhood and is the location of a bus station. This would be the first Israeli strike on the heart of the Lebanese capital during this round of conflict.","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57414"},"headline":"Catch up with our latest coverage","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57414","datePublished":"2024-09-30T08:12:16.771Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T08:12:16.771Z","author":[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com"}],"articleBody":"Sen. Mark Kelly says he’s not ready to condition U.S. aid to IsraelNetanyahu, not Biden, is setting the agenda in the Middle East","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57408"},"headline":"Hamas says its leader in Lebanon killed in strike","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57408","datePublished":"2024-09-30T08:12:18.537Z","dateModified":"2024-09-30T12:56:24.441Z","author":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Freddie Clayton","image":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/newscms/2026_05/3717929/250127_1x1_nbc_headshots_freddie_clayton_5339.jpg","description":"Freddie Clayton is a freelance journalist based in London. "}],"articleBody":"Hamas says Fateh Sherif Abu Al-Amin, the group’s leader in Lebanon, has been killed in an Israeli airstrike in the country's south.\n\nIn a statement posted on Telegram, the Palestinian militant group said Al-Amin was killed alongside his wife and children \"in their home in the (Al-Bas) camp.\"\n\nWhile Hamas is based in Gaza, it has long had a presence in Lebanon.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-1500w,q_auto:best/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg","caption":"Lebanese soldiers stand guard near an apartment building that was hit by an Israeli air strike central Beirut on September 30, 2024. "}}],"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218"},"publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC News","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/nbc-news-digital-editors-n893846","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/v1696280688/newsgroup-logos/nbcnews/logo/primary-black-424x45.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcnews","https://www.pinterest.com/nbcnews/","https://www.facebook.com/NBCNews/","https://www.instagram.com/nbcnews/","https://www.youtube.com/nbcnews","https://www.snapchat.com/p/8bb879c7-45c0-499c-bb3c-7a3d0e229301/2193844248074240","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcnews?lang=en"],"subOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"NBC Select","masthead":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select/shopping/masthead-rcna167949","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/select","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/h_60/newsgroup-logos/nbc-select/logo-horizontal/default-blue-360x102.png"},"sameAs":["https://x.com/nbcselect","https://www.facebook.com/NBCSelect","https://www.instagram.com/nbcselect/","https://www.youtube.com/@NBCSelect","https://www.tiktok.com/@nbcselect","https://www.threads.com/@nbcselect","https://bsky.app/profile/nbcselect.nbcnews.com"]}},"inLanguage":"en","articleBody":" What we know Israeli soldiers have started &quot;targeted&quot; ground operations inside Lebanon, the IDF said. Israeli officials notified the U.S. that the incursion would be limited in scope, scale and duration. The operation would aim to push Hezbollah forces farther away from the Israeli border.  Israel has expanded its attacks on Iran-backed militant groups across the region after the killing of the powerful Hezbollah leader Hassan Nasrallah.  Israel has also launched small special forces operations into southern Lebanon ahead of a potential ground offensive, an Israeli official told NBC News. Yoav Gallant, Israel&#x27;s defense minister, said the “next phase in the war against Hezbollah will begin soon.”  Elsewhere, Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu warned in comments directed at Iran that nowhere in the Middle East was beyond Israel’s reach two days after Israel killed Nasrallah. The head of the U.N. Palestinian refugee agency, UNRWA, denied knowing that its employee Fateh Sherif Abu el-Amin was a Hamas commander in Lebanon. The head of Hamas’ Lebanon branch was killed along with family members in an Israeli strike, the group said earlier.  President Joe Biden called for a cease-fire “right now” when he was asked whether he was comfortable with Israeli plans to invade Lebanon. “I’m more aware than you might know, and I’m comfortable with them stopping,” he told reporters at the White House. \n\nCoverage on this live blog has ended. Follow live updates here."}</script><script async src="https://assets.adobedtm.com/launch-EN03682f66064449c8b87d78eae3e2fc57.min.js"></script><script id="hfs-config" async>(function(){const hfsBrand = "news";
