iv’s “Hostage Square” was turned off after the remains of the last Israeli hostage held in Gaza were returned. The clock had been ticking since Hamas militants kidnapped 251 Israelis during its Oct. 7, 2023, terror attack.",{"primary":"du"},{"name":"2k"},{"name":"3m"},"https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/nbcnews/captions/2026/01/f_mo_lon_hostage_square_clock_260128_0622.srt","https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/nbcnews/captions/2026/01/f_mo_lon_hostage_square_clock_260128_0622.vtt",{"srt":"dy","webvtt":"dz"},"https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/f_mo_lon_hostage_square_clock_260128/2/abs/index.m3u8",{"assetType":"15","format":"16","publicUrl":"e1","height":"18","width":"19","assetDuration":"3s","bitrate":"3t"},"https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/nbcnews/video/2026/01/f_mo_lon_hostage_square_clock_260128_0622_4500.mp4",4514613,{"assetType":"1d","format":"1e","publicUrl":"e3","height":"18","width":"19","assetDuration":"3s","bitrate":"e4"},["e2","e5"],{"type":"g","id":"de","mpxMetadata":"dh","primaryImage":"do","url":"dr","duration":"3e","sentiment":"r","videoType":"3f","headline":"dt","description":"dv","publisher":"dw","source":"dx","closedCaptioning":"e0","videoAssets":"e6"},"mmvo256481349710","256481349710","now_daily_b_idf_database_260123",{"id":"e9","guid":"ea","externalAdvertiserId":"ea"},"vidimg3515631978",{"primary":"1k","tease":"1k","seo":"1k","social":"1k"},"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/mpx/2704722219/2026_01/1769201947359_now_daily_b_idf_database_260123_1920x1080-h2gcfz.jpg",{"primary":"ee"},{"publishedAt":"1o","createdAt":"1o","modifiedAt":"1o"},[],{"id":"ec","headline":"ed","caption":"1k","altText":"1k","url":"ef","encodingFormat":"1k","height":"1k","width":"1k","date":"eg","authors":"eh","source":"1k"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/now/video/nbc-news-investigates-alleged-incidents-of-wrongdoing-by-the-idf-in-gaza-256481349710","nbc-news-investigates-alleged-incidents-of-wrongdoing-by-the-idf-in-gaza-256481349710",{"canonical":"ej","primary":"ej","slug":"ek"},"PT4M14S","NBC News investigates alleged incidents of wrongdoing by the IDF in Gaza",{"primary":"en","seo":"en"},"During Israel's war with Hamas in Gaza, NBC News' investigation into the Israeli Defense Forces showed at least 175 incidents of wrongdoing by the IDF. Correspondent Daniele Hamamdjian explains how the IDF responded and what became of the inquiries into the alleged abuses.",{"primary":"ep"},{"name":"2k"},{"name":"a7"},"https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/nbcnews/captions/2026/01/1769201947359_now_daily_b_idf_database_260123.srt","https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/nbcnews/captions/2026/01/1769201947359_now_daily_b_idf_database_260123.vtt",{"srt":"et","webvtt":"eu"},"https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/now_daily_b_idf_database_260123/1/abs/index.m3u8",253.689,4220000,{"assetType":"15","format":"16","publicUrl":"ew","height":"18","width":"19","assetDuration":"ex","bitrate":"ey"},"https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/nbcnews/video/2026/01/1769201947359_now_daily_b_idf_database_260123_6.mp4",4220505,{"assetType":"1d","format":"1e","publicUrl":"f0","height":"18","width":"19","assetDuration":"ex","bitrate":"f1"},["ez","f2"],{"type":"g","id":"e8","mpxMetadata":"eb","primaryImage":"ei","url":"el","duration":"em","sentiment":"84","videoType":"2e","headline":"eo","description":"eq","publisher":"er","source":"es","closedCaptioning":"ev","videoAssets":"f3"},"mmvo256432709987","256432709987","now_staytuned_gaza_board_of_peace_260122",{"id":"f6","guid":"f7","externalAdvertiserId":"f7"},"vidimg3087068874",{"primary":"1k","tease":"1k","seo":"1k","social":"1k"},"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/mpx/2704722219/2026_01/1769135266035_now_staytuned_gaza_board_of_peace_260122_1920x1080-kz0k7u.jpg",{"primary":"fb"},{"publishedAt":"1o","createdAt":"1o","modifiedAt