,"seo":"1ad"},{"primary":"1af"},{"name":"em"},{"name":"17s"},{"srt":"1aj","webvtt":"1ak"},{"assetType":"gy","format":"gz","publicUrl":"1am","height":"h1","width":"h2","assetDuration":"1an","bitrate":"1ao"},{"assetType":"h6","format":"h7","publicUrl":"1aq","height":"h1","width":"h2","assetDuration":"1an","bitrate":"1ar"},["1nl","1nm"],{"type":"gb","id":"19y","mpxMetadata":"1n9","primaryImage":"1ne","url":"1nf","duration":"1ac","sentiment":"l3","videoType":"i6","headline":"1ng","description":"1nh","publisher":"1ni","source":"1nj","closedCaptioning":"1nk","videoAssets":"1nn"},{"id":"1aw","guid":"1ax","externalAdvertiserId":"1ax"},{"primary":"eh","tease":"eh","seo":"eh","social":"eh"},{"primary":"1b1"},{"publishedAt":"eg","createdAt":"eg","modifiedAt":"eg"},[],{"id":"1az","headline":"1nq","caption":"eh","altText":"eh","url":"1nr","encodingFormat":"eh","height":"eh","width":"eh","date":"1ns","authors":"1nt","source":"eh"},{"canonical":"1b6","primary":"1b6","slug":"1b7"},{"primary":"1ba","seo":"1ba"},{"primary":"1bc"},{"name":"em"},{"name":"fv"},{"srt":"1bg","webvtt":"1bh"},{"assetType":"gy","format":"gz","publicUrl":"1bj","height":"h1","width":"h2","assetDuration":"1bk","bitrate":"1bl"},{"assetType":"h6","format":"h7","publicUrl":"1bn","height":"h1","width":"h2","assetDuration":"1bk","bitrate":"1bo"},["1o1","1o2"],{"type":"gb","id":"1av","mpxMetadata":"1np","primaryImage":"1nu","url":"1nv","duration":"1b9","sentiment":"l3","videoType":"gl","headline":"1nw","description":"1nx","publisher":"1ny","source":"1nz","closedCaptioning":"1o0","videoAssets":"1o3"},["1mc","1ms","1n8","1no","1o4"],{"headline":"1lw","videos":"1o5"},{"id":"1ks","type":"gb","duration":"1kt","dateBroadcast":"1ku","date":"1kx","liveVideoStatus":"gg","playable":"e7","mpxMetadata":"1l0","sentiment":"l3","videoType":"gl","contentRules":"1l2","headline":"1l4","description":"1l6","url":"1l9","closedCaptioning":"1lc","videoAssets":"1lj","primaryImage":"1lq","teaseImage":"1lv","associatedVideoPlaylist":"1o6"},{"type":"g9","video":"1o7"},"Scores of families could be seen sitting on the floor, with bedding nearby. Drying laundry hung on a fence surrounding the parking lot. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1o9"},"\"We have many needs,\" a man carrying an infant told an NBC News crew. \"The most important one is shelter for the children.\"",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1ob"},"About 1 million people have been displaced in Lebanon as a result of the escalating conflict between Israel and Hezbollah, according to Prime Minister Najib Mikati.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1od"},["1kr","1o8","1oa","1oc","1oe"],["1kq","1o9","1ob","1od"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"1of","text":"1og"},"2024-09-30T20:14:44.870Z","2024-10-01T00:11:30.542Z",{"createdAt":"1oi","publishedAt":"1oi","modifiedAt":"1oj"},{"primary":"1kq","seo":"1kq"},"Displaced people fleeing southern Lebanon take shelter in parking lot ",{"primary":"1om","seo":"1om","social":"1om"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57517",{"primary":"1op"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"1or"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"1ot"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"1ov"},{"analysis":"1os","citations":"1ou","verdict":"1ow"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"1ju","authors":"1kp","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"1oh","date":"1ok","description":"1ol","headline":"1on","presentation":"1oo","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"1oq","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"1ox","replies":"1oy"},"rcrd57515",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"ot"},["1p1"],["oz"],{"primary":"p4"},{"altText":"p2","height":"p3","url":"1p4","width":"p3"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"p8","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"p8","youtube":"eh"},{"canonical":"pa","primary":"pa","slug":"pb"},{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"pd"},["1p9"],[],{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"ph"},["1pc"],{"bio":"1p2","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"ow","id":"ox","email":"oy","jobTitle":"1p3","name":"p1","primaryImage":"1p5","publisher":"1p6","socialMediaProfiles":"1p7","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"1p8","worksFor":"eh","experience":"1pa","educationAndExpertise":"1pb","awards":"1pd"},["1pe"],"The Israel Defense Forces announced the designation of \"a closed military area\" in northern Israel ahead of a possible ground operation in Lebanon.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1pg"},"The area consists of the town of Metula and two kibbutzim, Meshgav Am and Kfar Giladi, <a href=\"https://x.com/idfonline/status/1840808915816022375?s=48&t=tVc4Vo-omv6F2hrEpddh9g\" target=\"_blank\">the IDF said on X</a>, adding that entering the area is prohibited.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1pi"},"A limited ground operation into Lebanon could begin as early as today, according to a U.S. official, a Biden administration official and a source familiar with the planning.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1pk"},"rcim317202",{"primary":"eh","tease":"eh","seo":"eh","social":"eh"},"Israeli tanks by the Israeli-Lebanese border today.","Israeli tanks and APC's gathered at the border","https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2024-09/240930-israel-lebanon-border-tanks-se-311p-7455b2.jpg",{"primary":"1pq"},"2024-09-30T19:13:34.685Z","2024-09-30T20:10:04.061Z",{"publishedAt":"1ps","createdAt":"1ps","modifiedAt":"1pt"},"Erik Marmor",{"name":"1pv"},["1pw"],"Getty Images",{"name":"1py"},{"id":"1pm","headline":"1pn","caption":"1po","altText":"1pp","url":"1pr","encodingFormat":"1hd","height":"1he","width":"1hf","date":"1pu","authors":"1px","source":"1pz"},{"type":"1h7","image":"1q0"},["1ph","1pj","1pl","1q1"],"The area consists of the town of Metula and two kibbutzim, Meshgav Am and Kfar Giladi, the IDF said on X, adding that entering the area is prohibited.",["1pg","1q3","1pk"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"1q2","text":"1q4"},"2024-09-30T19:45:10.266Z","2024-10-01T00:12:08.730Z",{"createdAt":"1q6","publishedAt":"1q6","modifiedAt":"1q7"},{"primary":"1pg","seo":"1pg"},"IDF designates 'closed military area' in northern Israel ahead of ground operation in Lebanon",{"primary":"1qa","seo":"1qa","social":"1qa"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57515",{"primary":"1qd"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"1qf"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"1qh"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"1qj"},{"analysis":"1qg","citations":"1qi","verdict":"1qk"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"1p0","authors":"1pf","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"1q5","date":"1q8","description":"1q9","headline":"1qb","presentation":"1qc","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"1qe","reportingFrom":"eg","factCheckContent":"1ql","replies":"1qm"},"rcrd57501","Khalid Razak is a producer for NBC News based in Baghdad.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1qp"},["1qq"],"ncpn1260478",[],"Khalid Razak",{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"1qr","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"1qs","email":"eh","jobTitle":"1qt","name":"1qu","primaryImage":"eh","publisher":"1qv","socialMediaProfiles":"1qw","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"1qx","educationAndExpertise":"1qy","awards":"1qz"},["1r0"],"Seventeen Lebanese refugees crossed into Iraq via the Al-Qaim border between Syria and Iraq, the Iraqi Red Crescent said today. Among them was a wounded person, it added.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1r2"},"\"The Red Crescent teams received the displaced and provided food services and first aid, especially to the wounded,\" it said in a statement. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1r4"},"To date, 144 Lebanese refugees have crossed into Iraq through the Al-Qaim border, the statement said. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1r6"},["1r3","1r5","1r7"],["1r2","1r4","1r6"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"1r8","text":"1r9"},"2024-09-30T19:32:42.349Z","2024-10-01T00:12:35.624Z",{"createdAt":"1rb","publishedAt":"1rb","modifiedAt":"1rc"},"Seventeen Lebanese refugees crossed into Iraq via the Al-Qaim border between Syria and Iraq, the Iraqi Red Crescent said today.",{"primary":"1re","seo":"1re"},"Lebanese refugees cross into Iraq",{"primary":"1rg","seo":"1rg","social":"1rg"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57501",{"primary":"1rj"},"Reporting from Baghdad",[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"1rm"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"1ro"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"1rq"},{"analysis":"1rn","citations":"1rp","verdict":"1rr"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"1qo","authors":"1r1","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"1ra","date":"1rd","description":"1rf","headline":"1rh","presentation":"1ri","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"1rk","reportingFrom":"1rl","factCheckContent":"1rs","replies":"1rt"},"rcrd57480","Henry Austin is a senior editor for NBC News Digital based in London.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1rw"},["1rx"],"ncpn4346","henry.austin@nbcuni.com","Contributor",["1s1"],"Henry Austin",1138,"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/newscms/2026_05/3718022/250128_1x1_nbc_headshots_henry_austin_5899.jpg",{"primary":"1s5"},1139,{"altText":"eh","height":"1s4","url":"1s6","width":"1s7"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},"@henrya1",{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"1sa","youtube":"eh"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/henry-austin-ncpn4346","henry-austin-ncpn4346",{"canonical":"1sc","primary":"1sc","slug":"1sd"},[],[],[],{"bio":"1ry","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"1rz","email":"1s0","jobTitle":"1s2","name":"1s3","primaryImage":"1s8","publisher":"1s9","socialMediaProfiles":"1sb","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"1se","worksFor":"eh","experience":"1sf","educationAndExpertise":"1sg","awards":"1sh"},["1si"],"Lebanon’s health system remains impacted and overstretched by a new escalation of violence in the country, the World Health Organization said today  in a situation report. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1sk"},"Warning that displaced people were at increased risk of diseases, the United Nations agency said that around 118,466 new displacements took place between Sept. 23 and 27.  ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1sm"},"Israel continues to carry out airstrikes on targets in Beirut and elsewhere in Lebanon.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1so"},["1sl","1sn","1sp"],["1sk","1sm","1so"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"1sq","text":"1sr"},"2024-09-30T18:50:54.865Z","2024-09-30T18:55:25.112Z",{"createdAt":"1st","publishedAt":"1st","modifiedAt":"1su"},"Lebanon’s health system remains impacted and overstretched by a new escalation of violence in the country, the World Health Organization said today  in a",{"primary":"1sw","seo":"1sw"},"Lebanese health system overstretched, WHO warns ",{"primary":"1sy","seo":"1sy","social":"1sy"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57480",{"primary":"1t1"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"1t3"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"1t5"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"1t7"},{"analysis":"1t4","citations":"1t6","verdict":"1t8"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"1rv","authors":"1sj","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"1ss","date":"1sv","description":"1sx","headline":"1sz","presentation":"1t0","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"1t2","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"1t9","replies":"1ta"},"rcrd57503","Raf Sanchez is a foreign correspondent for NBC News.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1td"},["1te"],"ncpn1222031",[],"Raf Sanchez","https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/newscms/2026_05/3718031/250127_1x1_nbc_headshots_raf_sanchez_5366.jpg",{"primary":"1tj"},{"altText":"eh","height":"1he","url":"1tk","width":"1he"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"1tf","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"1tg","email":"eh","jobTitle":"1th","name":"1ti","primaryImage":"1tl","publisher":"1tm","socialMediaProfiles":"1tn","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"1to","educationAndExpertise":"1tp","awards":"1tq"},{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"15c"},["1ts"],[],{"primary":"15l"},{"altText":"15k","height":"p3","url":"1tv","width":"p3"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"15p","youtube":"eh"},{"canonical":"15r","primary":"15r","slug":"15s"},[],[],[],{"bio":"1tt","liveBlogShortBio":"15f","shortBio":"15f","id":"15g","email":"15h","jobTitle":"1tu","name":"15j","primaryImage":"1tw","publisher":"1tx","socialMediaProfiles":"1ty","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"1tz","worksFor":"eh","experience":"1u0","educationAndExpertise":"1u1","awards":"1u2"},{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"14t"},["1u4"],[],{"primary":"14z"},{"altText":"14y","height":"p3","url":"1u7","width":"p3"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"153","youtube":"eh"},{"canonical":"155","primary":"155","slug":"156"},[],[],[],{"bio":"1u5","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"14w","email":"eh","jobTitle":"1u6","name":"14y","primaryImage":"1u8","publisher":"1u9","socialMediaProfiles":"1ua","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"1ub","worksFor":"eh","experience":"1uc","educationAndExpertise":"1ud","awards":"1ue"},["1tr","1u3","1uf"],"Israel is planning a limited ground operation into Lebanon that could begin imminently, according to a U.S. official, a Biden administration official and a source familiar with the planning.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1uh"},"Israel informed the U.S. that the incursion into southern Lebanon could begin as early as today and that the intent is to push Hezbollah forces further away from the Israeli border and target their infrastructure, including stockpiles and weapons, the officials explained.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1uj"},"The offensive will be limited in duration and scope, possibly beginning as early as tonight and lasting for days, not weeks, they said, adding that the geographical reach will be limited.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1ul"},"Israel has begun probing operations already, the U.S. official said, including small-scale ground missions with their Special Forces. They have also deployed combat engineers and other troops for missions like breaching. The IDF currently has about five brigades forward deployed but not all of those are expected to move across the border, the official said.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1un"},"ncwd000999","CUSTOM_EMBED","SHOW_MORE_BUTTON",{"displayShowMore":"e7","type":"1ur"},{"size":"1j3","alignment":"1j2","style":"eg"},{"embed":"1us","presentation":"1ut"},{"name":"em"},{"id":"1up","type":"1it","name":"1uq","properties":"1uu","publisher":"1uv"},{"type":"1ir","widget":"1uw"},"The official stressed that the operation is intended to be limited in duration and scope, targeting Hezbollah stockpiles and weapons, including underground facilities.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1uy"},"Israel was planning for a larger invasion but after U.S. officials urged them to reconsider during extensive conversations over the weekend, they have decided to scale back, the administration and U.S. officials said.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1v0"},"But the Biden administration remains concerned the mission could expand, the administration official said, adding that President Joe Biden is still pushing for a cease-fire.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1v2"},["1ui","1uk","1um","1uo","1ux","1uz","1v1","1v3"],["1uh","1uj","1ul","1un","1uy","1v0","1v2"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"1v4","text":"1v5"},"2024-09-30T18:25:13.024Z","2024-09-30T18:38:48.670Z",{"createdAt":"1v7","publishedAt":"1v7","modifiedAt":"1v8"},"Israel is planning a limited ground operation into Lebanon that could begin imminently, according to a U.S. official, a Biden administration official and a",{"primary":"1va","seo":"1va"},"Israeli ground operation into southern Lebanon could begin today, officials say",{"primary":"1vc","seo":"1vc","social":"1vc"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57503",{"primary":"1vf"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"1vh"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"1vj"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"1vl"},{"analysis":"1vi","citations":"1vk","verdict":"1vm"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"1tc","authors":"1ug","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"1v6","date":"1v9","description":"1vb","headline":"1vd","presentation":"1ve","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"1vg","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"1vn","replies":"1vo"},"rcrd57486","Ammar Cheikh Omar is a producer for NBC News.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1vr"},["1vs"],"ncpn47051","Ammar.Cheikhomar@nbcuni.com","Producer",["1vw"],"Ammar Cheikh Omar",{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"1vt","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"1vu","email":"1vv","jobTitle":"1vx","name":"1vy","primaryImage":"eh","publisher":"1vz","socialMediaProfiles":"1w0","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"1w1","educationAndExpertise":"1w2","awards":"1w3"},{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"ot"},["1w5"],["oz"],{"primary":"p4"},{"altText":"p2","height":"p3","url":"1w8","width":"p3"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"p8","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"p8","youtube":"eh"},{"canonical":"pa","primary":"pa","slug":"pb"},{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"pd"},["1wd"],[],{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"ph"},["1wg"],{"bio":"1w6","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"ow","id":"ox","email":"oy","jobTitle":"1w7","name":"p1","primaryImage":"1w9","publisher":"1wa","socialMediaProfiles":"1wb","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"1wc","worksFor":"eh","experience":"1we","educationAndExpertise":"1wf","awards":"1wh"},["1w4","1wi"],"The Israeli attack on Al Hudaydah “will not deter the Yemeni people and their armed forces from performing their religious, humanitarian and moral duty towards the Palestinian and Lebanese peoples,” the statement said. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1wk"},"The IDF said it was targeting Houthi infrastructure to prevent the group’s ability to obtain supplies from Iran.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1wm"},["1wl","1wn"],["1wk","1wm"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"1wo","text":"1wp"},"2024-09-30T18:18:21.411Z","2024-09-30T18:39:57.676Z",{"createdAt":"1wr","publishedAt":"1wr","modifiedAt":"1ws"},"The Israeli attack on Al Hudaydah “will not deter the Yemeni people and their armed forces from performing their religious, humanitarian and moral duty towards",{"primary":"1wu","seo":"1wu"},"Houthis will respond to port strike 'by escalating military operations'","Houthis say they will respond to Israel port bombing 'by escalating military operations'",{"primary":"1ww","seo":"1wx","social":"1ww"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57486",{"primary":"1x0"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"1x2"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"1x4"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"1x6"},{"analysis":"1x3","citations":"1x5","verdict":"1x7"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"1vq","authors":"1wj","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"1wq","date":"1wt","description":"1wv","headline":"1wy","presentation":"1wz","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"1x1","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"1x8","replies":"1x9"},"rcrd5749