primary":"24k"},{"altText":"24j","height":"p3","url":"24l","width":"p3"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"24e","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"24f","email":"eh","jobTitle":"24h","name":"24i","primaryImage":"24m","publisher":"24n","socialMediaProfiles":"24o","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"24p","educationAndExpertise":"24q","awards":"24r"},{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"ot"},["24t"],["oz"],{"primary":"p4"},{"altText":"p2","height":"p3","url":"24w","width":"p3"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"p8","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"p8","youtube":"eh"},{"canonical":"pa","primary":"pa","slug":"pb"},{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"pd"},["251"],[],{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"ph"},["254"],{"bio":"24u","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"ow","id":"ox","email":"oy","jobTitle":"24v","name":"p1","primaryImage":"24x","publisher":"24y","socialMediaProfiles":"24z","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"250","worksFor":"eh","experience":"252","educationAndExpertise":"253","awards":"255"},["24s","256"],"Israel has informed the U.S. of their plans for limited ground operations in Lebanon focusing on infrastructure belonging to the Hezbollah militant group,  State Department spokesperson Matthew Miller said today.  ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"258"},"“They have at this time, told us that those are limited operations focused on Hezbollah, infrastructure, near the border but we’re in continuous conversations,” Miller told reporters at a briefing.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"25a"},"Israel and Hezbollah have been trading fire across Lebanon's southern border since Oct. 8, the day after Hamas launched its cross-border terror attacks on Israel.  ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"25c"},"Earlier in the day, Israel's defense minister said \"the next phase in the war against Hezbollah will begin soon,” adding that the goal was to return residents of north Israel to their homes. However, Yoav Gallant did not elaborate on what this new phase would entail. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"25e"},["259","25b","25d","25f"],["258","25a","25c","25e"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"25g","text":"25h"},"2024-09-30T17:52:40.623Z","2024-09-30T18:43:30.329Z",{"createdAt":"25j","publishedAt":"25j","modifiedAt":"25k"},"Israel has informed the U.S. of their plans for limited ground operations in Lebanon focusing on infrastructure belonging to the Hezbollah militant group,  Stat",{"primary":"25m","seo":"25m"},"Israel informed U.S. of plans for limited operations in Lebanon, State Department says",{"primary":"25o","seo":"25o","social":"25o"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57494",{"primary":"25r"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"25t"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"25v"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"25x"},{"analysis":"25u","citations":"25w","verdict":"25y"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"24b","authors":"257","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"25i","date":"25l","description":"25n","headline":"25p","presentation":"25q","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"25s","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"25z","replies":"260"},"rcrd57493",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1td"},["263"],[],{"primary":"1tj"},{"altText":"eh","height":"1he","url":"266","width":"1he"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"264","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"1tg","email":"eh","jobTitle":"265","name":"1ti","primaryImage":"267","publisher":"268","socialMediaProfiles":"269","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"26a","educationAndExpertise":"26b","awards":"26c"},["26d"],"Israel's security cabinet will meet at 9 p.m. local time (2 p.m. ET) amid growing indications an Israeli ground offensive into southern Lebanon may be imminent, an Israeli official told NBC News today.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"26f"},["26g"],["26f"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"26h","text":"26i"},"2024-09-30T17:25:14.303Z","2024-09-30T18:44:00.237Z",{"createdAt":"26k","publishedAt":"26k","modifiedAt":"26l"},"Israel's security cabinet will meet at 9 p.m. local time (2 p.m.",{"primary":"26n","seo":"26n"},"Israel's security cabinet to meet as ground offensive looms",{"primary":"26p","seo":"26p","social":"26p"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57493",{"primary":"26s"},"Reporting from Haifa, Israel",[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"26v"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"26x"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"26z"},{"analysis":"26w","citations":"26y","verdict":"270"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"262","authors":"26e","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"26j","date":"26m","description":"26o","headline":"26q","presentation":"26r","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"26t","reportingFrom":"26u","factCheckContent":"271","replies":"272"},"rcrd57489",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"ot"},["275"],["oz"],{"primary":"p4"},{"altText":"p2","height":"p3","url":"278","width":"p3"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"p8","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"p8","youtube":"eh"},{"canonical":"pa","primary":"pa","slug":"pb"},{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"pd"},["27d"],[],{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"ph"},["27g"],{"bio":"276","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"ow","id":"ox","email":"oy","jobTitle":"277","name":"p1","primaryImage":"279","publisher":"27a","socialMediaProfiles":"27b","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"27c","worksFor":"eh","experience":"27e","educationAndExpertise":"27f","awards":"27h"},["27i"],"Foreign ministers from the European Union held an emergency meeting on Lebanon today, according to Peter Stano, lead spokesperson for the external affairs of the E.U.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"27k"},"The high representative of the union will give a statement shortly, Stano said. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"27m"},"The gathering comes days after the E.U. said that it would provide 10 million euros ($11.1 million) in aid for people in Lebanon affected by the “ongoing escalation of hostilities” between Israel and Hezbollah.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"27o"},"“This emergency funding aims to tackle the most urgent needs such as protection, food assistance, shelter and health care,” a statement from the E.U. said Saturday. “The E.U. stands ready to provide further support by mobilising all the available emergency response tools, including via use of the Civil Protection Mechanism.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"27q"},{"displayShowMore":"e7","type":"1ur"},{"size":"1j3","alignment":"1j2","style":"eg"},{"embed":"27s","presentation":"27t"},{"name":"em"},{"id":"1up","type":"1it","name":"1uq","properties":"27u","publisher":"27v"},{"type":"1ir","widget":"27w"},"“People in Lebanon, including refugees, were already experiencing high levels of poverty and food insecurity while having limited access to services,” the E.U. added. “Nearly 2 million Lebanese and Syrian refugees are estimated to be food insecure. This number is expected to rise further.”",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"27y"},["27l","27n","27p","27r","27x","27z"],["27k","27m","27o","27q","27y"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"280","text":"281"},"2024-09-30T17:16:56.879Z","2024-09-30T18:52:52.234Z",{"createdAt":"283","publishedAt":"283","modifiedAt":"284"},"Foreign ministers from the European Union held an emergency meeting on Lebanon today, according to Peter Stano, lead spokesperson for the external affairs of",{"primary":"286","seo":"286"},"E.U. foreign ministers hold emergency meeting on Lebanon escalation ",{"primary":"288","seo":"288","social":"288"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57489",{"primary":"28b"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"28d"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"28f"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"28h"},{"analysis":"28e","citations":"28g","verdict":"28i"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"274","authors":"27j","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"282","date":"285","description":"287","headline":"289","presentation":"28a","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"28c","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"28j","replies":"28k"},"rcrd57485",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"ot"},["28n"],["oz"],{"primary":"p4"},{"altText":"p2","height":"p3","url":"28q","width":"p3"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"p8","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"p8","youtube":"eh"},{"canonical":"pa","primary":"pa","slug":"pb"},{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"pd"},["28v"],[],{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"ph"},["28y"],{"bio":"28o","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"ow","id":"ox","email":"oy","jobTitle":"28p","name":"p1","primaryImage":"28r","publisher":"28s","socialMediaProfiles":"28t","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"28u","worksFor":"eh","experience":"28w","educationAndExpertise":"28x","awards":"28z"},["290"],"The “next phase in the war against Hezbollah will begin soon,” Israel's defense minister said in a post on X today. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"292"},"Yoav Gallant said the phase \"will be a significant factor in achieving the goal of the war — returning the residents of the north to their homes.\"",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"294"},"He did not say what this phase would entail. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"296"},"rcim317069",{"primary":"eh","tease":"eh","seo":"eh","social":"eh"},"Soldiers work on tanks and armored personnel carriers in northern Israel today.","Israeli soldiers work on tanks and armored personnel carriers in northern Israel, Monday, Sept. 30, 2024. ","https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2024-09/240930-northern-israel-mn-1300-2d7142.jpg",{"primary":"29c"},1333,2000,"2024-09-30T17:00:29.419Z",{"publishedAt":"29g","createdAt":"29g","modifiedAt":"29g"},"Leo Correa",{"name":"29i"},["29j"],{"name":"1hl"},{"id":"298","headline":"299","caption":"29a","altText":"29b","url":"29d","encodingFormat":"1hd","height":"29e","width":"29f","date":"29h","authors":"29k","source":"29l"},{"type":"1h7","image":"29m"},["293","295","297","29n"],["292","294","296"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"29o","text":"29p"},"2024-09-30T16:53:17.672Z","2024-09-30T17:01:12.416Z",{"createdAt":"29r","publishedAt":"29r","modifiedAt":"29s"},"The “next phase in the war against Hezbollah will begin soon,” Israel's defense minister said in a post on X today.",{"primary":"29u","seo":"29u"},"Israeli defense minister says 'next phase in the war against Hezbollah will begin soon'",{"primary":"29w","seo":"29w","social":"29w"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57485",{"primary":"29z"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2a1"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2a3"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2a5"},{"analysis":"2a2","citations":"2a4","verdict":"2a6"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"28m","authors":"291","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"29q","date":"29t","description":"29v","headline":"29x","presentation":"29y","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"2a0","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"2a7","replies":"2a8"},"rcrd57483",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"fv"},["2ab"],[],{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"g1","instagram":"em","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"g2","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"2ac","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"fy","email":"eh","jobTitle":"2ad","name":"fv","primaryImage":"eh","publisher":"2ae","socialMediaProfiles":"2af","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"2ag","educationAndExpertise":"2ah","awards":"2ai"},["2aj"],"An Israel Defense Forces soldier was “severely injured” during combat in southern Gaza, the military said in a statement today. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2al"},"The soldier is from the 8108th battalion of the 679th brigade, the IDF said. The soldier was not named and the extent of the injuries are not known. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2an"},"“The soldier was evacuated to a hospital for further treatment, his family was notified,” the statement added.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2ap"},["2am","2ao","2aq"],["2al","2an","2ap"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2ar","text":"2as"},"2024-09-30T16:45:46.250Z",{"createdAt":"2au","publishedAt":"2au","modifiedAt":"2au"},"An Israel Defense Forces soldier was “severely injured” during combat in southern Gaza, the military said in a statement today.",{"primary":"2aw","seo":"2aw"},"IDF soldier 'severely injured' during combat in southern Gaza",{"primary":"2ay","seo":"2ay","social":"2ay"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57483",{"primary":"2b1"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2b3"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2b5"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2b7"},{"analysis":"2b4","citations":"2b6","verdict":"2b8"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"2aa","authors":"2ak","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"2at","date":"2av","description":"2ax","headline":"2az","presentation":"2b0","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"2b2","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"2b9","replies":"2ba"},"rcrd57446","Freddie Clayton is a freelance journalist based in London. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2bd"},["2be"],"ncpn1309769",[],"Freddie Clayton",1520,"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/newscms/2026_05/3717929/250127_1x1_nbc_headshots_freddie_clayton_5339.jpg",{"primary":"2bk"},{"altText":"eh","height":"2bj","url":"2bl","width":"2bj"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"2bf","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"2bg","email":"eh","jobTitle":"2bh","name":"2bi","primaryImage":"2bm","publisher":"2bn","socialMediaProfiles":"2bo","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"2bp","educationAndExpertise":"2bq","awards":"2br"},{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1vr"},["2bt"],["1vw"],{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"2bu","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"1vu","email":"1vv","jobTitle":"2bv","name":"1vy","primaryImage":"eh","publisher":"2bw","socialMediaProfiles":"2bx","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"2by","educationAndExpertise":"2bz","awards":"2c0"},["2bs","2c1"],"Lebanon is ready to send its army south of the Litani river, the nation’s Prime Minister Najib Mikati told reporters today.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2c3"},"Mikati said his government was “ready to implement the 1701 agreement,” referencing a 2006 U.N. resolution that aimed to end Hezbollah’s armed presence in the south as part of an agreement to end a 34-day war with Israel.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2c5"},"The resolution also called for a full Israeli withdrawal from southern Lebanon. The Litani river lies about 20 miles from Lebanon’s southern border.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2c7"},"“We confirm our agreement and pledge to implement the ceasefire immediately to discuss the implementation of U.N. Resolution 1701,” said Mikati. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2c9"},["2c4","2c6","2c8","2ca"],["2c3","2c5","2c7","2c9"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2cb","text":"2cc"},"2024-09-30T16:35:08.261Z",{"createdAt":"2ce","publishedAt":"2ce","modifiedAt":"2ce"},{"primary":"2c3","seo":"2c3"},"Lebanese PM ready to send army south of Litani River",{"primary":"2ch","seo":"2ch","social":"2ch"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57446",{"primary":"2ck"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2cm"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2co"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2cq"},{"analysis":"2cn","citations":"2cp","verdict":"2cr"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"2bc","authors":"2c2","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"2cd","date":"2cf","description":"2cg","headline":"2ci","presentation":"2cj","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"2cl","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"2cs","replies":"2ct"},"rcrd57477",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1e8"},["2cw"],[],{"primary":"1ee"},{"altText":"eh","height":"1ed","url":"2cz","width":"1ed"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"2cx","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"1eb","email":"eh","jobTitle":"2cy","name":"1e8","primaryImage":"2d0","publisher":"2d1","socialMediaProfiles":"2d2","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"2d3","educationAndExpertise":"2d4","awards":"2d5"},["2d6"],"The U.N. Palestinian refugee agency (UNRWA) chief today denied knowing that its employee Fateh Sherif Abu el-Amin was a Hamas commander in Lebanon and called on states to push back against Israeli attacks on the agency.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2d8"},"The head of Hamas’ Lebanon branch, Abu el-Amin was killed along with family members in an Israeli strike in southern Lebanon, the group said today. He was suspended from his job at UNRWA in March following allegations concerning his politics, Philippe Lazzarini told reporters in Geneva.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2da"},"“I never heard the word commander before,” he said. “What’s obvious for you today, was not obvious yesterday.” ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2dc"},["2d9","2db","2dd"],["2d8","2da","2dc"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2de","text":"2df"},"2024-09-30T16:03:33.872Z","2024-09-30T16:05:40.351Z",{"createdAt":"2dh","publishedAt":"2dh","modifiedAt":"2di"},"The U.N.",{"primary":"2dk","seo":"2dk"},"UNRWA chief denies knowledge that suspended employee was Hamas leader in Lebanon  ",{"primary":"2dm","seo":"2dm","social":"2dm"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57477",{"primary":"2dp"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2dr"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2dt"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2dv"},{"analysis":"2ds","citations":"2du","verdict":"2dw"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"2cv","authors":"2d7","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"2dg","date":"2dj","description":"2dl","headline":"2dn","presentation":"2do","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"2dq","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"2dx","replies":"2dy"},"rcrd57470","Sarah Dean is a White House Producer for NBC News.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2e1"},["2e2"],"ncpn1281478","Sarah.Dean@nbcuni.com",[],"Sarah Dean","https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/newscms/2024_31/3656901/240729-sarah-dean.jpg",{"primary":"2e8"},{"altText":"2e7","height":"p3","url":"2e9","width":"p3"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/sarah-dean-ncpn1281478","sarah-dean-ncpn1281478",{"canonical":"2ed","primary":"2ed","slug":"2ee"},[],[],[],{"bio":"2e3","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"2e4","email":"2e5","jobTitle":"2e6","name":"2e7","primaryImage":"2ea","publisher":"2eb","socialMediaProfiles":"2ec","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"2ef","worksFor":"eh","experience":"2eg","educationAndExpertise":"2eh","awards":"2ei"},["2ej"],"There should be a cease-fire “right now,” President Joe Biden said today when asked whether he was comfortable with Israel’s plan to invade Lebanon in its fight against Hezbollah.  ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2el"},"“I’m more aware than you might know and I’m comfortable with them stopping,” he told reporters at the White House. “We should have a cease-fire right now.”",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2en"},"rcim317087",{"primary":"eh","tease":"eh","seo":"eh","social":"eh"},"Mourners gather today for the funeral of commanders of the Popular Front For the Liberation of Palestine who were killed by an overnight Israeli airstrike in Beirut, at a camp camp for Palestinian refugees near Tripoli, Lebanon.","Mourners gather for the funeral ","https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2024-09/240930-lebanon-mn-1300-770dcb.jpg",{"primary":"2et"},1201,1800,"2024-09-30T17:14:46.809Z",{"publishedAt":"2ex","createdAt":"2ex","modifiedAt":"2ex"},"Fathi Al-Masri",{"name":"2ez"},["2f0"],"AFP - Getty Images",{"name":"2f2"},{"id":"2ep","headline":"2eq","caption":"2er","altText":"2es","url":"2eu","encodingFormat":"1hd","height":"2ev","width":"2ew","date":"2ey","authors":"2f1","source":"2f3"},{"type":"1h7","image":"2f4"},["2em","2eo","2f5"],["2el","2en"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2f6","text":"2f7"},"2024-09-30T16:00:29.981Z","2024-09-30T17:17:43.588Z",{"createdAt":"2f9","publishedAt":"2f9","modifiedAt":"2fa"},"There should be a cease-fire “right now,” President Joe Biden said today when asked whether he was comfortable with Israel’s plan to invade Lebanon in its",{"primary":"2fc","seo":"2fc"},"'We should have a cease-fire right now,' Biden says",{"primary":"2fe","seo":"2fe","social":"2fe"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57470",{"primary":"2fh"},"Reporting from Washington",[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2fk"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2fm"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2fo"},{"analysis":"2fl","citations":"2fn","verdict":"2fp"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"2e0","authors":"2ek","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"2f8","date":"2fb","description":"2fd","headline":"2ff","presentation":"2fg","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"2fi","reportingFrom":"2fj","factCheckContent":"2fq","replies":"2fr"},"rcrd57475",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1vr"},["2fu"],["1vw"],{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"2fv","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"1vu","email":"1vv","jobTitle":"2fw","name":"1vy","primaryImage":"eh","publisher":"2fx","socialMediaProfiles":"2fy","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"2fz","educationAndExpertise":"2g0","awards":"2g1"},{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1e8"},["2g3"],[],{"primary":"1ee"},{"altText":"eh","height":"1ed","url":"2g6","width":"1ed"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"2g4","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"1eb","email":"eh","jobTitle":"2g5","name":"1e8","primaryImage":"2g7","publisher":"2g8","socialMediaProfiles":"2g9","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"2ga","educationAndExpertise":"2gb","awards":"2gc"},["2g2","2gd"],"Hezbollah said in a statement that it fired a Nour missile at Israel, which sources familiar with the Lebanese militant group told Reuters is a ballistic missile. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2gf"},"The missile hit the village of Kafr Giladi in northern Israel, the statement said, adding that it had fired it in response to “Israeli violations of cities, villages, and civilians.” ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2gh"}," It was the first time they have used the missile, the statement said. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2gj"},["2gg","2gi","2gk"],["2gf","2gh","2gj"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2gl","text":"2gm"},"2024-09-30T15:52:05.783Z","2024-09-30T15:59:23.626Z",{"createdAt":"2go","publishedAt":"2go","modifiedAt":"2gp"},"Hezbollah said in a statement that it fired a Nour missile at Israel, which sources familiar with the Lebanese militant group told Reuters is a ballistic",{"primary":"2gr","seo":"2gr"},"Hezbollah fires Nour missile into northern Israel ",{"primary":"2gt","seo":"2gt","social":"2gt"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57475",{"primary":"2gw"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2gy"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2h0"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2h2"},{"analysis":"2gz","citations":"2h1","verdict":"2h3"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"2ft","authors":"2ge","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"2gn","date":"2gq","description":"2gs","headline":"2gu","presentation":"2gv","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"2gx","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"2h4","replies":"2h5"},"rcrd57471","Ian Sherwood is an Executive Editor for NBC News overseeing Richard Engel’s editorial team.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2h8"},["2h9"],"ncpn375076",[],"Ian Sherwood","https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/newscms/2024_32/3658445/240730-ian_sherwood.jpg",{"primary":"2he"},{"altText":"eh","height":"1hf","url":"2hf","width":"1hf"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},"IanJSherwood",{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"2hi","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"2ha","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"2hb","email":"eh","jobTitle":"2hc","name":"2hd","primaryImage":"2hg","publisher":"2hh","socialMediaProfiles":"2hj","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"2hk","educationAndExpertise":"2hl","awards":"2hm"},["2hn"],"Iran faces “no good options in retaliting against Israel,” following the assassination of Hezbollah leader Hassan Nasrallah, according to a senior research fellow at the Royal United Services Institute, a London based think tank. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2hp"},"Burcu Ozcelik said in a commentary that Iran could “mobilize militia in Iraq and Syria against Israeli, U.S. and U.K. targets, but refrain from direct confrontation.” ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2hr"},"She added that Iran could mobilize attacks from the Yemen-based Houthi militia “against sensitive targets inside Israel.\"",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2ht"},"“With Hezbollah now in crisis, the Houthis may gain more operational significance. An escalation in Houthi-led harassment and attacks on commercial shipping in the Red Sea may be expected,” she said. Tehran also backs the Houthis. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2hv"},{"displayShowMore":"e7","type":"1ur"},{"size":"1j3","alignment":"1j2","style":"eg"},{"embed":"2hx","presentation":"2hy"},{"name":"em"},{"id":"1up","type":"1it","name":"1uq","properties":"2hz","publisher":"2i0"},{"type":"1ir","widget":"2i1"},"Third, she said, Iran could attack Israel directly which “may salvage Iran’s credibility with its core base” inside the country but could erode the country’s “projection of military strength and cause a legitimacy crisis inside Iran.”   ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2i3"},"“If a negotiated ceasefire in Gaza was not enough of a priority before, it is even more important now. It may now be the crucial lever needed to initiate a process of de-escalation,\" she said. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2i5"},["2hq","2hs","2hu","2hw","2i2","2i4","2i6"],["2hp","2hr","2ht","2hv","2i3","2i5"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2i7","text":"2i8"},"2024-09-30T15:41:12.888Z","2024-09-30T16:00:23.116Z",{"createdAt":"2ia","publishedAt":"2ia","modifiedAt":"2ib"},"Iran faces “no good options in retaliting against Israel,” following the assassination of Hezbollah leader Hassan Nasrallah, according to a senior research",{"primary":"2id","seo":"2id"},"Iran has 'no good options' to retaliate against Israel, leading analyst concludes",{"primary":"2if","seo":"2if","social":"2if"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57471",{"primary":"2ii"},"Reporting from London",[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2il"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2in"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2ip"},{"analysis":"2im","citations":"2io","verdict":"2iq"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"2h7","authors":"2ho","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"2i9","date":"2ic","description":"2ie","headline":"2ig","presentation":"2ih","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"2ij","reportingFrom":"2ik","factCheckContent":"2ir","replies":"2is"},"rcrd57460",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2bd"},["2iv"],[],{"primary":"2bk"},{"altText":"eh","height":"2bj","url":"2iy","width":"2bj"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"2iw","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"2bg","email":"eh","jobTitle":"2ix","name":"2bi","primaryImage":"2iz","publisher":"2j0","socialMediaProfiles":"2j1","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"2j2","educationAndExpertise":"2j3","awards":"2j4"},{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1vr"},["2j6"],["1vw"],{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"2j7","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"1vu","email":"1vv","jobTitle":"2j8","name":"1vy","primaryImage":"eh","publisher":"2j9","socialMediaProfiles":"2ja","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"2jb","educationAndExpertise":"2jc","awards":"2jd"},["2j5","2je"],"The Islamic Resistance in Iraq said in a statement today that it attacked four Israeli targets in response to Israel's attacks on Lebanon and Gaza.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2jg"},"It said that it attacked two “vital” targets in the Israeli port city of Haifa using drones, as well as two other unspecified targets.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2ji"},"NBC News has reached out to the IDF for comment. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2jk"},["2jh","2jj","2jl"],["2jg","2ji","2jk"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2jm","text":"2jn"},"2024-09-30T14:59:25.364Z",{"createdAt":"2jp","publishedAt":"2jp","modifiedAt":"2jp"},{"primary":"2jg","seo":"2jg"},"Islamic Resistance in Iraq claims two strikes on Haifa",{"primary":"2js","seo":"2js","social":"2js"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57460",{"primary":"2jv"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2jx"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2jz"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2k1"},{"analysis":"2jy","citations":"2k0","verdict":"2k2"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"2iu","authors":"2jf","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"2jo","date":"2jq","description":"2jr","headline":"2jt","presentation":"2ju","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"2jw","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"2k3","replies":"2k4"},"rcrd57463","Carlo Angerer is a multimedia producer and reporter based in Mainz, Germany. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2k7"},["2k8"],"ncpn12126",["1vw"],"Carlo Angerer",{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},"https://www.facebook.com/carloangerer","carloangerer","@carloangerer",{"email":"eh","facebook":"2ke","instagram":"2kf","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"2kg","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"2k9","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"2ka","email":"eh","jobTitle":"2kb","name":"2kc","primaryImage":"eh","publisher":"2kd","socialMediaProfiles":"2kh","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"2ki","educationAndExpertise":"2kj","awards":"2kk"},["2kl"],"Germany has started to fly non-essential personnel and the family members of embassy employees out of Israel, Lebanon and the occupied West Bank, the country's foreign office said in a statement today.   ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2kn"},"\"In view of the situation, the Federal Foreign Office raised the crisis level for the foreign missions in Beirut, Ramallah and Tel Aviv again at the weekend and initiated a diplomatic pick-up,\" the statement said. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2kp"},"\"This means that the embassies remain operational, but family members of the posted employees and of German intermediary organizations as well as non-essential personnel are flying out,\" it added. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2kr"},"“The embassy continues to support the remaining Germans in Lebanon in their departure via commercial flights and other means,” it said.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2kt"},["2ko","2kq","2ks","2ku"],["2kn","2kp","2kr","2kt"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2kv","text":"2kw"},"2024-09-30T14:45:07.997Z",{"createdAt":"2ky","publishedAt":"2ky","modifiedAt":"2ky"},"Germany has started to fly non-essential personnel and the family members of embassy employees out of Israel, Lebanon and the occupied West Bank, the country's",{"primary":"2l0","seo":"2l0"},"Germany flies embassy employee families and non-essential embassy personnel out of the region",{"primary":"2l2","seo":"2l2","social":"2l2"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57463",{"primary":"2l5"},"Reporting from Munich",[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2l8"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2la"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2lc"},{"analysis":"2l9","citations":"2lb","verdict":"2ld"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"2k6","authors":"2km","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"2kx","date":"2kz","description":"2l1","headline":"2l3","presentation":"2l4","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"2l6","reportingFrom":"2l7","factCheckContent":"2le","replies":"2lf"},"rcrd57465","F. Brinley Bruton is Assistant Managing Editor for International News, NBC News Digital. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2li"},["2lj"],"ncpn721","brinley.bruton@nbcuni.com","Editor and Senior writer - London",["2ln"],"F. Brinley Bruton ",1439,"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/newscms/2026_05/3718021/250127_1x1_nbc_headshots_brinley_bruton_5536.jpg",{"primary":"2lr"},{"altText":"eh","height":"2lq","url":"2ls","width":"2lq"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},"@BrinleyBruton",{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"2lv","youtube":"eh"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/f-brinley-bruton-ncpn721","f-brinley-bruton-ncpn721",{"canonical":"2lx","primary":"2lx","slug":"2ly"},[],[],[],{"bio":"2lk","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"2ll","email":"2lm","jobTitle":"2lo","name":"2lp","primaryImage":"2lt","publisher":"2lu","socialMediaProfiles":"2lw","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"2lz","worksFor":"eh","experience":"2m0","educationAndExpertise":"2m1","awards":"2m2"},["2m3"],"There is nowhere in the Middle East that Israel cannot reach, Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu warned today in comments directed at Iran, two days after Israel killed the leader of Tehran-backed Lebanese militant group Hezbollah.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2m5"},"Speaking in English in a three-minute video clip released by his office, Netanyahu said he was addressing “the people of Iran.”",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2m7"},"“There is nowhere in the Middle East Israel cannot reach.  There is nowhere we will not go to protect our people and protect our country,” Netanyahu said. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2m9"},"“Don’t let a small group of fanatic theocrats crush your hopes and your dreams,” he added. “You deserve better.”",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2mb"},"https://x.com/netanyahu/status/1840740049299583355","The people of Iran should know - Israel stands with you pic.twitter.com/MfwfNqnTgE— Benjamin Netanyahu - בנימין נתניהו (@netanyahu) September 30, 2024\n\n\n","Benjamin Netanyahu - בנימין נתניהו on Twitter / X","<amp-iframe src=\"https://iframe.nbcnews.com/LTG1csa?_showcaption=true&amp=1\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen layout=\"responsive\" resizable sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-forms allow-top-navigation-by-user-activation\"><amp-img layout=\"fill\" src=\"https://iframe.nbcnews.com/amp169/thumbnail\" placeholder></amp-img><button overflow>Read more</button></amp-iframe>","<div class=\"iframely-twitter iframely-app iframely-embed\" style=\"max-width: 550px;\"><div class=\"iframely-responsive\" style=\"padding-bottom: 100%;\"><iframe src=\"//iframe.nbcnews.com/LTG1csa?_showcaption=true&app=1\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div>","LTG1csa",{"canonical-url":"2md","description":"2me","headline":"2mf","iframely-embed-amp-html":"2mg","iframely-embed-html":"2mh","iframely-embed-id":"2mi","iframely-embed-site":"1j1","presentation-alignment":"1j2","presentation-size":"1j3"},{"name":"em"},{"id":"1is","type":"1it","name":"1iu","properties":"2mj","publisher":"2mk"},{"type":"1ir","widget":"2ml"},["2m6","2m8","2ma","2mc","2mm"],["2m5","2m7","2m9","2mb"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2mn","text":"2mo"},"2024-09-30T14:38:15.321Z","2024-09-30T15:17:21.006Z",{"createdAt":"2mq","publishedAt":"2mq","modifiedAt":"2mr"},"There is nowhere in the Middle East that Israel cannot reach, Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu warned today in comments directed at Iran, two days",{"primary":"2mt","seo":"2mt"},"Netanyahu says nowhere in Middle East out of Israel’s reach",{"primary":"2mv","seo":"2mv","social":"2mv"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57465",{"primary":"2my"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2n0"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2n2"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2n4"},{"analysis":"2n1","citations":"2n3","verdict":"2n5"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"2lh","authors":"2m4","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"2mp","date":"2ms","description":"2mu","headline":"2mw","presentation":"2mx","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"2mz","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"2n6","replies":"2n7"},"rcrd57457",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2bd"},["2na"],[],{"primary":"2bk"},{"altText":"eh","height":"2bj","url":"2nd","width":"2bj"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"2nb","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"2bg","email":"eh","jobTitle":"2nc","name":"2bi","primaryImage":"2ne","publisher":"2nf","socialMediaProfiles":"2ng","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"2nh","educationAndExpertise":"2ni","awards":"2nj"},["2nk"],"Bahrain’s King Hamad bin Isa Al Khalifa said today that it was important to preserve Lebanon’s sovereignty and revive efforts to reach a cease-fire in Gaza.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2nm"},"Bahrain is home to the U.S. Navy 5th Fleet and has close ties to the U.S. It has long blamed Iran, a Muslim Shia nation, for stirring up its own majority Shia population against its Sunni monarchy. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2no"},["2nn","2np"],["2nm","2no"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2nq","text":"2nr"},"2024-09-30T14:24:55.312Z","2024-09-30T14:49:23.772Z",{"createdAt":"2nt","publishedAt":"2nt","modifiedAt":"2nu"},{"primary":"2nm","seo":"2nm"},"Bahrain’s king urges preservation of Lebanon's sovereignty ",{"primary":"2nx","seo":"2nx","social":"2nx"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57457",{"primary":"2o0"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2o2"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2o4"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2o6"},{"analysis":"2o3","citations":"2o5","verdict":"2o7"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"2n9","authors":"2nl","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"2ns","date":"2nv","description":"2nw","headline":"2ny","presentation":"2nz","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"2o1","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"2o8","replies":"2o9"},"rcrd57454",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2bd"},["2oc"],[],{"primary":"2bk"},{"altText":"eh","height":"2bj","url":"2of","width":"2bj"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"2od","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"2bg","email":"eh","jobTitle":"2oe","name":"2bi","primaryImage":"2og","publisher":"2oh","socialMediaProfiles":"2oi","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"2oj","educationAndExpertise":"2ok","awards":"2ol"},["2om"],"The U.S. Embassy in Beirut said it is working with airlines to help citizens depart Lebanon by providing additional flights. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2oo"},"Many airlines have stopped flying to Lebanon since Israel intensified its offensive in the past fortnight.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2oq"},"https://twitter.com/usembassybeirut/status/1840728771713712419","The U.S. Embassy in Beirut is working with airlines to address U.S. citizens requests to depart Lebanon by providing additional flights with seats for personal purchase.  For more information and to complete our intake form visit our website: https://t.co/6ssIKvvOI9 pic.twitter.com/SkJ4Pqfg5z— U.S. Embassy Beirut (@usembassybeirut) September 30, 2024\n\n\n","U.S. Embassy Beirut on Twitter / X","<amp-iframe src=\"https://iframe.nbcnews.com/vNcejYj?_showcaption=true&amp=1\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen layout=\"responsive\" resizable sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-forms allow-top-navigation-by-user-activation\"><amp-img layout=\"fill\" src=\"https://iframe.nbcnews.com/amp169/thumbnail\" placeholder></amp-img><button overflow>Read more</button></amp-iframe>","<div class=\"iframely-twitter iframely-app iframely-embed\" style=\"max-width: 550px;\"><div class=\"iframely-responsive\" style=\"padding-bottom: 100%;\"><iframe src=\"//iframe.nbcnews.com/vNcejYj?_showcaption=true&app=1\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div>","vNcejYj",{"canonical-url":"2os","description":"2ot","headline":"2ou","iframely-embed-amp-html":"2ov","iframely-embed-html":"2ow","iframely-embed-id":"2ox","iframely-embed-site":"1j1","presentation-alignment":"1j2","presentation-size":"1j3"},{"name":"em"},{"id":"1is","type":"1it","name":"1iu","properties":"2oy","publisher":"2oz"},{"type":"1ir","widget":"2p0"},["2op","2or","2p1"],["2oo","2oq"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2p2","text":"2p3"},"2024-09-30T13:51:41.214Z",{"createdAt":"2p5","publishedAt":"2p5","modifiedAt":"2p5"},"The U.S. Embassy in Beirut said it is working with airlines to help citizens depart Lebanon by providing additional flights.",{"primary":"2p7","seo":"2p7"},"U.S. Embassy working with airlines in Lebanon",{"primary":"2p9","seo":"2p9","social":"2p9"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57454",{"primary":"2pc"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2pe"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2pg"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2pi"},{"analysis":"2pf","citations":"2ph","verdict":"2pj"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"2ob","authors":"2on","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"2p4","date":"2p6","description":"2p8","headline":"2pa","presentation":"2pb","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"2pd","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"2pk","replies":"2pl"},"rcrd57443",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2bd"},["2po"],[],{"primary":"2bk"},{"altText":"eh","height":"2bj","url":"2pr","width":"2bj"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"2pp","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"2bg","email":"eh","jobTitle":"2pq","name":"2bi","primaryImage":"2ps","publisher":"2pt","socialMediaProfiles":"2pu","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"2pv","educationAndExpertise":"2pw","awards":"2px"},["2py"],"The risk of a major war in the Middle East is “very high,” following the death of Hezbollah leader Hassan Nasrallah, Kremlin spokesman Dmitry Peskov told reporters today. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2q0"},"Condemning Nasrallah’s death, Peskov said Russia believed it had “significantly destabilized the situation in the region.”",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2q2"},"“Such indiscriminate bombings of residential areas in Lebanon lead to a huge amount of victims and will inevitably result in a humanitarian disaster, the same as we see in Gaza,” he said. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2q4"},"“We cannot ignore such consequences and we cannot help being deeply concerned over them,” he added.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2q6"},["2q1","2q3","2q5","2q7"],["2q0","2q2","2q4","2q6"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2q8","text":"2q9"},"2024-09-30T13:40:20.011Z",{"createdAt":"2qb","publishedAt":"2qb","modifiedAt":"2qb"},"The risk of a major war in the Middle East is “very high,” following the death of Hezbollah leader Hassan Nasrallah, Kremlin spokesman Dmitry Peskov told",{"primary":"2qd","seo":"2qd"},"Russia warns of 'very high' risk of regional war ",{"primary":"2qf","seo":"2qf","social":"2qf"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57443",{"primary":"2qi"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2qk"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2qm"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2qo"},{"analysis":"2ql","citations":"2qn","verdict":"2qp"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"2pn","authors":"2pz","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"2qa","date":"2qc","description":"2qe","headline":"2qg","presentation":"2qh","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"2qj","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"2qq","replies":"2qr"},"rcrd57419","Will Clark is a freelance photo and video editor for NBC News based in London.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2qu"},["2qv"],"ncpn657846","will.clark@nbcuni.com",[],"Will Clark","https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/newscms/2024_32/3658449/240730-will-clark.jpg",{"primary":"2r1"},{"altText":"eh","height":"1hf","url":"2r2","width":"1hf"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"2qw","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"2qx","email":"2qy","jobTitle":"2qz","name":"2r0","primaryImage":"2r3","publisher":"2r4","socialMediaProfiles":"2r5","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"2r6","educationAndExpertise":"2r7","awards":"2r8"},["2r9"],"Satellite images taken Aug. 25 and yesterday show the area of southern Beirut where Hezbollah leader Hassan Nasrallah was killed by an Israeli airstrike.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2rb"},"rcim316804",{"primary":"eh","tease":"eh","seo":"eh","social":"eh"},"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-before-after-wc-0922-f5e0cd.jpg",{"primary":"2rf"},1875,"2024-09-30T08:26:43.853Z",{"publishedAt":"2ri","createdAt":"2ri","modifiedAt":"2ri"},{"name":"eg"},["2rk"],"Planet Labs",{"name":"2rm"},{"id":"2rd","headline":"2re","caption":"eg","altText":"eg","url":"2rg","encodingFormat":"1hd","height":"2rh","width":"1hf","date":"2rj","authors":"2rl","source":"2rn"},{"type":"1h7","image":"2ro"},["2rc","2rp"],["2rb"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2rq","text":"2rr"},"2024-09-30T13:20:06.944Z","2024-09-30T13:24:12.081Z",{"createdAt":"2rt","publishedAt":"2rt","modifiedAt":"2ru"},{"primary":"2rb","seo":"2rb"},"Satellite images show craters left by Israeli airstrike on Nasrallah's bunker",{"primary":"2rx","seo":"2rx","social":"2rx"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57419",{"primary":"2s0"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2s2"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2s4"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2s6"},{"analysis":"2s3","citations":"2s5","verdict":"2s7"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"2qt","authors":"2ra","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"2rs","date":"2rv","description":"2rw","headline":"2ry","presentation":"2rz","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"2s1","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"2s8","replies":"2s9"},"rcrd57440","Yarden Segev is a news coordinater for NBC News based in Israel.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2sc"},["2sd"],"ncpn1308397",[],"Yarden Segev",{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"2se","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"2sf","email":"eh","jobTitle":"2sg","name":"2sh","primaryImage":"eh","publisher":"2si","socialMediaProfiles":"2sj","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"2sk","educationAndExpertise":"2sl","awards":"2sm"},["2sn"],"Israel is prepared to “make every effort necessary” in order to ensure the return of its northern communities, the country's defense minister said today on a visit to the border with Lebanon.  ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2sp"},"“Our goal is to ensure the [safe] return of Israel’s northern communities to their homes,” Yoav Gallant was quoted as saying in a statement. “We will use all the means that may be required — your forces, other forces, from the air, from the sea, and on land.”",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2sr"},"The statement said Gallant was briefed about the readiness of troops for the possibility of expanding activities in the north.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2st"},["2sq","2ss","2su"],["2sp","2sr","2st"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2sv","text":"2sw"},"2024-09-30T13:00:26.305Z","2024-09-30T13:28:42.539Z",{"createdAt":"2sy","publishedAt":"2sy","modifiedAt":"2sz"},"Israel is prepared to “make every effort necessary” in order to ensure the return of its northern communities, the country's defense minister said today on a",{"primary":"2t1","seo":"2t1"},"Goal is safe return of northern communities, Israeli defense minister says",{"primary":"2t3","seo":"2t3","social":"2t3"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57440",{"primary":"2t6"},"Reporting from Tel Aviv",[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2t9"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2tb"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2td"},{"analysis":"2ta","citations":"2tc","verdict":"2te"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"2sb","authors":"2so","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"2sx","date":"2t0","description":"2t2","headline":"2t4","presentation":"2t5","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"2t7","reportingFrom":"2t8","factCheckContent":"2tf","replies":"2tg"},"rcrd57449",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1vr"},["2tj"],["1vw"],{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"2tk","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"1vu","email":"1vv","jobTitle":"2tl","name":"1vy","primaryImage":"eh","publisher":"2tm","socialMediaProfiles":"2tn","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"2to","educationAndExpertise":"2tp","awards":"2tq"},{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2bd"},["2ts"],[],{"primary":"2bk"},{"altText":"eh","height":"2bj","url":"2tv","width":"2bj"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"2tt","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"2bg","email":"eh","jobTitle":"2tu","name":"2bi","primaryImage":"2tw","publisher":"2tx","socialMediaProfiles":"2ty","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"2tz","educationAndExpertise":"2u0","awards":"2u1"},["2tr","2u2"],"A Lebanese soldier was killed by an Israeli drone, the country's army said today in a post on X. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2u4"},"The drone targeted a motorcycle while it was passing through an army checkpoint, the post said. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2u6"},"https://twitter.com/LebarmyOfficial/status/1840728964383318492","استشهد أحد العسكريين نتيجة استهداف مسيّرة تابعة للعدو الإسرائيلي دراجة نارية أثناء مرورها عند حاجز العمرة- الوزاني التابع للجيش اللبناني.#الجيش_اللبناني #LebaneseArmy pic.twitter.com/AtbQwJA4Ty— الجيش اللبناني (@LebarmyOfficial) September 30, 2024\n\n\n","الجيش اللبناني on Twitter / X","<amp-iframe src=\"https://iframe.nbcnews.com/2IezrHR?_showcaption=true&amp=1\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen layout=\"responsive\" resizable sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-forms allow-top-navigation-by-user-activation\"><amp-img layout=\"fill\" src=\"https://iframe.nbcnews.com/amp169/thumbnail\" placeholder></amp-img><button overflow>Read more</button></amp-iframe>","<div class=\"iframely-twitter iframely-app iframely-embed\" style=\"max-width: 550px;\"><div class=\"iframely-responsive\" style=\"padding-bottom: 100%;\"><iframe src=\"//iframe.nbcnews.com/2IezrHR?_showcaption=true&app=1\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div>","2IezrHR",{"canonical-url":"2u8","description":"2u9","headline":"2ua","iframely-embed-amp-html":"2ub","iframely-embed-html":"2uc","iframely-embed-id":"2ud","iframely-embed-site":"1j1","presentation-alignment":"1j2","presentation-size":"1j3"},{"name":"em"},{"id":"1is","type":"1it","name":"1iu","properties":"2ue","publisher":"2uf"},{"type":"1ir","widget":"2ug"},["2u5","2u7","2uh"],["2u4","2u6"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2ui","text":"2uj"},"2024-09-30T12:38:44.458Z","2024-09-30T12:51:04.071Z",{"createdAt":"2ul","publishedAt":"2ul","modifiedAt":"2um"},"A Lebanese soldier was killed by an Israeli drone, the country's army said today in a post on X.",{"primary":"2uo","seo":"2uo"},"Soldier killed by Israeli drone, Lebanese army says ",{"primary":"2uq","seo":"2uq","social":"2uq"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57449",{"primary":"2ut"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2uv"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2ux"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2uz"},{"analysis":"2uw","citations":"2uy","verdict":"2v0"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"2ti","authors":"2u3","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"2uk","date":"2un","description":"2up","headline":"2ur","presentation":"2us","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"2uu","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"2v1","replies":"2v2"},"rcrd57422",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2bd"},["2v5"],[],{"primary":"2bk"},{"altText":"eh","height":"2bj","url":"2v8","width":"2bj"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"2v6","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"2bg","email":"eh","jobTitle":"2v7","name":"2bi","primaryImage":"2v9","publisher":"2va","socialMediaProfiles":"2vb","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"2vc","educationAndExpertise":"2vd","awards":"2ve"},["2vf"],"More than 100,000 Lebanese nationals and Syrians living in Lebanon have crossed into Syria as they flee Israeli airstrikes, the United Nations High Commissioner for Refugees said today. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2vh"},"Filippo Grandi said in a post on X that the U.N. Relief and Works Agency is present at four crossing points alongside local authorities and the Syrian Red Crescent to support new arrivals.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2vj"},"Separately, the U.N. Relief and Works Agency, known as UNRWA, said 1,424 people, almost <a href=\"https://mailchi.mp/unrwa/unrwa-situation-report-2-on-the-lebanon-emergency-response-12711753?e=a400be43e6\" target=\"_blank\">half of them children</a>, are registered at its emergency shelters in Lebanon.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2vl"},"https://twitter.com/FilippoGrandi/status/1840652202332815480","The number of people who have crossed into Syria from Lebanon fleeing Israeli airstrikes — Lebanese and Syrian nationals — has reached 100,000. The outflow continues.UNHCR is present at four crossing points alongside local authorities and @SYRedCrescent to support new arrivals. pic.twitter.com/7dtrghsMH4— Filippo Grandi (@FilippoGrandi) September 30, 2024\n\n\n","Filippo Grandi on Twitter / X","<amp-iframe src=\"https://iframe.nbcnews.com/o85y4Ea?_showcaption=true&amp=1\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen layout=\"responsive\" resizable sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-forms allow-top-navigation-by-user-activation\"><amp-img layout=\"fill\" src=\"https://iframe.nbcnews.com/amp169/thumbnail\" placeholder></amp-img><button overflow>Read more</button></amp-iframe>","<div class=\"iframely-twitter iframely-app iframely-embed\" style=\"max-width: 550px;\"><div class=\"iframely-responsive\" style=\"padding-bottom: 100%;\"><iframe src=\"//iframe.nbcnews.com/o85y4Ea?_showcaption=true&app=1\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div>","o85y4Ea",{"canonical-url":"2vn","description":"2vo","headline":"2vp","iframely-embed-amp-html":"2vq","iframely-embed-html":"2vr","iframely-embed-id":"2vs","iframely-embed-site":"1j1","presentation-alignment":"1j2","presentation-size":"1j3"},{"name":"em"},{"id":"1is","type":"1it","name":"1iu","properties":"2vt","publisher":"2vu"},{"type":"1ir","widget":"2vv"},["2vi","2vk","2vm","2vw"],"Separately, the U.N. Relief and Works Agency, known as UNRWA, said 1,424 people, almost half of them children, are registered at its emergency shelters in Lebanon.",["2vh","2vj","2vy"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2vx","text":"2vz"},"2024-09-30T12:33:45.851Z",{"createdAt":"2w1","publishedAt":"2w1","modifiedAt":"2w1"},"More than 100,000 Lebanese nationals and Syrians living in Lebanon have crossed into Syria as they flee Israeli airstrikes, the United Nations High Commissioner",{"primary":"2w3","seo":"2w3"},"100,000 have fled Lebanon for Syria, U.N. says ",{"primary":"2w5","seo":"2w5","social":"2w5"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57422",{"primary":"2w8"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2wa"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2wc"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2we"},{"analysis":"2wb","citations":"2wd","verdict":"2wf"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"2v4","authors":"2vg","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"2w0","date":"2w2","description":"2w4","headline":"2w6","presentation":"2w7","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"2w9","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"2wg","replies":"2wh"},"rcrd57423","Chantal Da Silva reports on world news for NBC News Digital and is based in London.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2wk"},["2wl"],"ncpn1269216","Chantal.DaSilva@nbcuni.com",[],"Chantal Da Silva","https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/newscms/2024_32/3658438/240730-chantal-da-silva.jpg",{"primary":"2wr"},{"altText":"eh","height":"1hf","url":"2ws","width":"1hf"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/chantal-da-silva-ncpn1269216","chantal-da-silva-ncpn1269216",{"canonical":"2ww","primary":"2ww","slug":"2wx"},[],[],[],{"bio":"2wm","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"2wk","id":"2wn","email":"2wo","jobTitle":"2wp","name":"2wq","primaryImage":"2wt","publisher":"2wu","socialMediaProfiles":"2wv","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"2wy","worksFor":"eh","experience":"2wz","educationAndExpertise":"2x0","awards":"2x1"},["2x2"],"Fears are growing that “no one is safe” in Lebanon after Israel’s airstrike in central Beirut, according to the executive director of a humanitarian nongovernmental organization working to support families displaced by the bombing campaign. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2x4"},"Humanitarian workers were “shocked” by the strike in Beirut’s Cola district, Jihan Kaisi, the Executive Director of the Union of Relief and Development Associations, or URDA, told NBC News.  ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2x6"},"“This Cola area is crowded with families, with displaced families, who came to this area thinking it’s safe,” she said. “It’s a very crowded area.” And the strike targeting the area, just a couple of miles from downtown Beirut and the city’s Zaitunay Bay, she said, showed there was “no safe place guaranteed in Lebanon.” ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2x8"},"She added that a deadly strike in the Sidon or Saida area in southern Lebanon on Sunday, had also heightened fears in that part of the country.  ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2xa"},{"displayShowMore":"e7","type":"1ur"},{"size":"1j3","alignment":"1j2","style":"eg"},{"embed":"2xc","presentation":"2xd"},{"name":"em"},{"id":"1up","type":"1it","name":"1uq","properties":"2xe","publisher":"2xf"},{"type":"1ir","widget":"2xg"},"Thousands of families have been sheltering there under the belief that the heavily populated area would be safe and now they don’t know where else to go, she said.  ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2xi"},"Some families have been forced to sleep on the streets, in playgrounds and in parking lots after makeshift shelters set up in schools became too overcrowded, she added. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2xk"},"“It’s getting cold at night,” she said. “Imagine, children without any blanket at night. Imagine what is happening... what they will go through.” ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2xm"},"She said many people had expressed fears that Lebanon could soon become like Gaza. “There’s talk that Lebanon might face the same situation,” she said. “So, yes they are talking about that. Families are scared.”",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2xo"},["2x5","2x7","2x9","2xb","2xh","2xj","2xl","2xn","2xp"],["2x4","2x6","2x8","2xa","2xi","2xk","2xm","2xo"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2xq","text":"2xr"},"2024-09-30T12:00:54.315Z","2024-09-30T12:52:27.908Z",{"createdAt":"2xt","publishedAt":"2xt","modifiedAt":"2xu"},"Fears are growing that “no one is safe” in Lebanon after Israel’s airstrike in central Beirut, according to the executive director of a humanitarian",{"primary":"2xw","seo":"2xw"},"Beirut strike shows 'no safe place' in Lebanon, aid worker says ",{"primary":"2xy","seo":"2xy","social":"2xy"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57423",{"primary":"2y1"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2y3"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2y5"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2y7"},{"analysis":"2y4","citations":"2y6","verdict":"2y8"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"2wj","authors":"2x3","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"2xs","date":"2xv","description":"2xx","headline":"2xz","presentation":"2y0","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"2y2","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"2y9","replies":"2ya"},"rcrd57416",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2sc"},["2yd"],[],{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"2ye","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"2sf","email":"eh","jobTitle":"2yf","name":"2sh","primaryImage":"eh","publisher":"2yg","socialMediaProfiles":"2yh","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"2yi","educationAndExpertise":"2yj","awards":"2yk"},["2yl"],"People should be ready to seek shelter because Israel’s air defense is “not impenetrable,” according to the Commanding Officer of the Home Front Command in Northern Israel.   ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2yn"},"“When you hear an alert, immediately enter a sheltered space,” Rafi Milo said on a visit to the region last night. “If you don’t have access to a sheltered space, choose the safest space available and enter it — this saves lives. Stay alert, stay ready, and follow the instructions.”",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2yp"},["2yo","2yq"],["2yn","2yp"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2yr","text":"2ys"},"2024-09-30T11:46:13.713Z","2024-09-30T12:15:09.544Z",{"createdAt":"2yu","publishedAt":"2yu","modifiedAt":"2yv"},"People should be ready to seek shelter because Israel’s air defense is “not impenetrable,” according to the Commanding Officer of the Home Front Command in Nort",{"primary":"2yx","seo":"2yx"},"'Stay alert, Stay ready,' IDF warns people in northern Israel",{"primary":"2yz","seo":"2yz","social":"2yz"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57416",{"primary":"2z2"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2z4"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2z6"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"2z8"},{"analysis":"2z5","citations":"2z7","verdict":"2z9"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"2yc","authors":"2ym","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"2yt","date":"2yw","description":"2yy","headline":"2z0","presentation":"2z1","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"2z3","reportingFrom":"2t8","factCheckContent":"2za","replies":"2zb"},"rcrd57415",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2bd"},["2ze"],[],{"primary":"2bk"},{"altText":"eh","height":"2bj","url":"2zh","width":"2bj"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"2zf","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"2bg","email":"eh","jobTitle":"2zg","name":"2bi","primaryImage":"2zi","publisher":"2zj","socialMediaProfiles":"2zk","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"2zl","educationAndExpertise":"2zm","awards":"2zn"},["2zo"],"French Foreign Minister Jean-Noel Barrot called for an “immediate” end to Israeli airstrikes after he arrived in Lebanon yesterday with a delivery of humanitarian aid.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2zq"},"“We will always stand by the civilians,” he said in a post on X, adding that he had brought 12 tons of medical equipment to be used to treat 1,000 seriously injured people.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2zs"},"As Barrot arrived, his ministry announced that a second French person had been killed in Lebanon. It did not provide further details. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2zu"},"Last week, an 87-year-old Frenchwoman was killed after “a strong explosion” in the south of the country.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2zw"},"https://twitter.com/jnbarrot/status/1840478854395068538","J’arrive ce soir à Beyrouth où la France est engagée dans la protection des civils.Ce sont 12 tonnes de matériel médical acheminées par l’@EtatMajorFR que j’ai remis à nos partenaires libanais. Elles soigneront 1000 blessés graves.Nous serons toujours aux côtés des civils. pic.twitter.com/KhGAJ9fez7— Jean-Noël Barrot (@jnbarrot) September 29, 2024\n\n\n","Jean-Noël Barrot on Twitter / X","<amp-iframe src=\"https://iframe.nbcnews.com/0Q3cxgs?_showcaption=true&amp=1\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen layout=\"responsive\" resizable sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-forms allow-top-navigation-by-user-activation\"><amp-img layout=\"fill\" src=\"https://iframe.nbcnews.com/amp169/thumbnail\" placeholder></amp-img><button overflow>Read more</button></amp-iframe>","<div class=\"iframely-twitter iframely-app iframely-embed\" style=\"max-width: 550px;\"><div class=\"iframely-responsive\" style=\"padding-bottom: 100%;\"><iframe src=\"//iframe.nbcnews.com/0Q3cxgs?_showcaption=true&app=1\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div>","0Q3cxgs",{"canonical-url":"2zy","description":"2zz","headline":"300","iframely-embed-amp-html":"301","iframely-embed-html":"302","iframely-embed-id":"303","iframely-embed-site":"1j1","presentation-alignment":"1j2","presentation-size":"1j3"},{"name":"em"},{"id":"1is","type":"1it","name":"1iu","properties":"304","publisher":"305"},{"type":"1ir","widget":"306"},["2zr","2zt","2zv","2zx","307"],["2zq","2zs","2zu","2zw"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"308","text":"309"},"2024-09-30T11:31:17.799Z","2024-09-30T12:53:39.528Z",{"createdAt":"30b","publishedAt":"30b","modifiedAt":"30c"},"French Foreign Minister Jean-Noel Barrot called for an “immediate” end to Israeli airstrikes after he arrived in Lebanon yesterday with a delivery of",{"primary":"30e","seo":"30e"},"French foreign minister travels to Beirut after two nationals killed",{"primary":"30g","seo":"30g","social":"30g"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57415",{"primary":"30j"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"30l"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"30n"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"30p"},{"analysis":"30m","citations":"30o","verdict":"30q"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"2zd","authors":"2zp","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"30a","date":"30d","description":"30f","headline":"30h","presentation":"30i","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"30k","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"30r","replies":"30s"},"rcrd57427",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1e8"},["30v"],[],{"primary":"1ee"},{"altText":"eh","height":"1ed","url":"30y","width":"1ed"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"30w","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"1eb","email":"eh","jobTitle":"30x","name":"1e8","primaryImage":"30z","publisher":"310","socialMediaProfiles":"311","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"312","educationAndExpertise":"313","awards":"314"},["315"],"Israel’s killing of Hezbollah leader Sayyed Hassan Nasrallah in a powerful airstrike in Beirut constituted a use of its right to defend itself, a German foreign ministry spokesperson said today.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"317"},"“Hezbollah is of course a terrorist organization and it was obviously a meeting of the top leadership of Hezbollah, from which one can assume, even from a distance, that they were planning their further operations,” the spokesperson said.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"319"},"“So in this respect, there are also reasons to believe that the right to self-defense was exercised here,” he added.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"31b"},"Asked about the civilian deaths in the incident, the spokesperson said “every civilian victim is one civilian victim too many.”",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"31d"},["318","31a","31c","31e"],["317","319","31b","31d"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"31f","text":"31g"},"2024-09-30T11:16:50.514Z","2024-09-30T12:54:07.207Z",{"createdAt":"31i","publishedAt":"31i","modifiedAt":"31j"},"Israel’s killing of Hezbollah leader Sayyed Hassan Nasrallah in a powerful airstrike in Beirut constituted a use of its right to defend itself, a German",{"primary":"31l","seo":"31l"},"Nasrallah killing was Israeli self-defense, Germany says",{"primary":"31n","seo":"31n","social":"31n"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57427",{"primary":"31q"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"31s"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"31u"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"31w"},{"analysis":"31t","citations":"31v","verdict":"31x"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"30u","authors":"316","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"31h","date":"31k","description":"31m","headline":"31o","presentation":"31p","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"31r","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"31y","replies":"31z"},"rcrd57432",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1td"},["322"],[],{"primary":"1tj"},{"altText":"eh","height":"1he","url":"325","width":"1he"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"323","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"1tg","email":"eh","jobTitle":"324","name":"1ti","primaryImage":"326","publisher":"327","socialMediaProfiles":"328","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"329","educationAndExpertise":"32a","awards":"32b"},["32c"],"Israel has been launching small special forces operations into southern Lebanon ahead of a potential ground offensive, an Israeli official told NBC News. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"32e"},"The operations are designed to gather intelligence and probe Hezbollah’s positions. The official cautioned that such operations have been going on for months and do not necessarily signal the imminent start of a ground assault",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"32g"},["32f","32h"],["32e","32g"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"32i","text":"32j"},"2024-09-30T10:55:16.639Z",{"createdAt":"32l","publishedAt":"32l","modifiedAt":"32l"},"Israel has been launching small special forces operations into southern Lebanon ahead of a potential ground offensive, an Israeli official told NBC News.",{"primary":"32n","seo":"32n"},"Israeli special forces teams carrying out operations in Lebanon ",{"primary":"32p","seo":"32p","social":"32p"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57432",{"primary":"32s"},"Reporting from HAIFA, Israel",[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"32v"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"32x"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"32z"},{"analysis":"32w","citations":"32y","verdict":"330"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"321","authors":"32d","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"32k","date":"32m","description":"32o","headline":"32q","presentation":"32r","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"32t","reportingFrom":"32u","factCheckContent":"331","replies":"332"},"rcrd57424",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2bd"},["335"],[],{"primary":"2bk"},{"altText":"eh","height":"2bj","url":"338","width":"2bj"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"336","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"2bg","email":"eh","jobTitle":"337","name":"2bi","primaryImage":"339","publisher":"33a","socialMediaProfiles":"33b","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"33c","educationAndExpertise":"33d","awards":"33e"},{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1vr"},["33g"],["1vw"],{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"33h","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"1vu","email":"1vv","jobTitle":"33i","name":"1vy","primaryImage":"eh","publisher":"33j","socialMediaProfiles":"33k","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"33l","educationAndExpertise":"33m","awards":"33n"},["33f","33o"],"The deputy secretary general of Hezbollah, Naim Qassem, said the militant group is \"ready for the enemy to enter by land\" during a pre-recorded message televised today.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"33q"},"Qassem said that Hezbollah would \"not budge an inch\" in supporting Gaza and Palestine, and that the group would emerge victorious \"just as we did in 2006,\" recalling the 34-day conflict between Israel and Hezbollah. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"33s"},"rcim316814",{"primary":"eh","tease":"eh","seo":"eh","social":"eh"},"People watch a televised speech by Hezbollah's deputy chief Naim Qassem in a cafe in Beirut's southern suburbs.","In a televised address on September 30, the Iran-backed group's deputy chief Naim Qassem said a new chief to replace Nasrallah would be selected \"at the earliest opportunity\". ","https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2024-09/240930-hezbollah-address-wc-1142-153641.jpg",{"primary":"33y"},"2024-09-30T10:43:28.264Z",{"publishedAt":"340","createdAt":"340","modifiedAt":"340"},"Ibrahim Amro",{"name":"342"},["343"],{"name":"2f2"},{"id":"33u","headline":"33v","caption":"33w","altText":"33x","url":"33z","encodingFormat":"1hd","height":"1he","width":"1hf","date":"341","authors":"344","source":"345"},{"type":"1h7","image":"346"},"It’s the first major public comment from Hezbollah since its leader Hassan Nasrallah was killed by an Israeli airstrike in Beirut last week. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"348"},"Qassem said the group will choose Nasrallah's replacement \"as soon as possible.\"",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"34a"},["33r","33t","347","349","34b"],["33q","33s","348","34a"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"34c","text":"34d"},"2024-09-30T10:53:29.006Z","2024-09-30T12:55:08.714Z",{"createdAt":"34f","publishedAt":"34f","modifiedAt":"34g"},"The deputy secretary general of Hezbollah, Naim Qassem, said the militant group is \"ready for the enemy to enter by land\" during a pre-recorded message",{"primary":"34i","seo":"34i"},"Hezbollah says it is ready for 'ground encounter'  ",{"primary":"34k","seo":"34k","social":"34k"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57424",{"primary":"34n"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"34p"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"34r"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"34t"},{"analysis":"34q","citations":"34s","verdict":"34u"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"334","authors":"33p","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"34e","date":"34h","description":"34j","headline":"34l","presentation":"34m","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"34o","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"34v","replies":"34w"},"rcrd57425",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2bd"},["34z"],[],{"primary":"2bk"},{"altText":"eh","height":"2bj","url":"352","width":"2bj"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"350","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"2bg","email":"eh","jobTitle":"351","name":"2bi","primaryImage":"353","publisher":"354","socialMediaProfiles":"355","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"356","educationAndExpertise":"357","awards":"358"},{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2sc"},["35a"],[],{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"35b","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"2sf","email":"eh","jobTitle":"35c","name":"2sh","primaryImage":"eh","publisher":"35d","socialMediaProfiles":"35e","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"35f","educationAndExpertise":"35g","awards":"35h"},["359","35i"],"The IDF and Israel Security Agency issued a joint statement today saying they had killed Hamas' leader in Lebanon, Fateh Sherif Abu Al-Amin.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"35k"},"The statement said the Israeli air forces struck Al-Amin overnight.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"35m"},"Earlier, Hamas said the leader and his family were killed in an Israeli airstrike at their home in southern Lebanon.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"35o"},["35l","35n","35p"],["35k","35m","35o"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"35q","text":"35r"},"2024-09-30T10:27:48.404Z","2024-09-30T13:28:09.882Z",{"createdAt":"35t","publishedAt":"35t","modifiedAt":"35u"},{"primary":"35k","seo":"35k"},"Israel confirms it killed Hamas leader in Lebanon",{"primary":"35x","seo":"35x","social":"35x"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57425",{"primary":"360"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"362"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"364"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"366"},{"analysis":"363","citations":"365","verdict":"367"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"34y","authors":"35j","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"35s","date":"35v","description":"35w","headline":"35y","presentation":"35z","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"361","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"368","replies":"369"},"rcrd57413",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"fv"},["36c"],[],{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"g1","instagram":"em","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"g2","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"36d","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"fy","email":"eh","jobTitle":"36e","name":"fv","primaryImage":"eh","publisher":"36f","socialMediaProfiles":"36g","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"36h","educationAndExpertise":"36i","awards":"36j"},["36k"],"Photos show the damage to an apartment building in Beirut's southern suburb of Ghobeiry after an overnight Israeli airstrike targeted the area today.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"36m"},"rcim316800",{"primary":"eh","tease":"eh","seo":"eh","social":"eh"},"A view of the damage at the site of an Israeli strike on Beirut's southern suburb of Ghobeiry.","Image: LEBANON-ISRAEL-PALESTINIAN-CONFLICT","https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2024-09/240930-lebanon-strike-ghobeiry-wc-0837-edb70d.jpg",{"primary":"36s"},"2024-09-30T07:37:32.837Z",{"publishedAt":"36u","createdAt":"36u","modifiedAt":"36u"},{"name":"eg"},["36w"],{"name":"2f2"},{"id":"36o","headline":"36p","caption":"36q","altText":"36r","url":"36t","encodingFormat":"1hd","height":"1he","width":"1hf","date":"36v","authors":"36x","source":"36y"},{"type":"1h7","image":"36z"},"rcim316802",{"primary":"eh","tease":"eh","seo":"eh","social":"eh"},"A man inspects the damage in Ghobeiry.","https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2024-09/240930-ghobeiry-airstrike-damage-wc-0840-abd680.jpg",{"primary":"374"},"2024-09-30T07:41:23.006Z",{"publishedAt":"376","createdAt":"376","modifiedAt":"376"},{"name":"eg"},["378"],{"name":"2f2"},{"id":"371","headline":"372","caption":"373","altText":"36r","url":"375","encodingFormat":"1hd","height":"1he","width":"1hf","date":"377","authors":"379","source":"37a"},{"type":"1h7","image":"37b"},"rcim316801",{"primary":"eh","tease":"eh","seo":"eh","social":"eh"},"People survey the damage after the Israeli strike.","https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2024-09/240930-ghobeiry-strike-wc-0838-2ef278.jpg",{"primary":"37g"},"2024-09-30T07:39:03.176Z",{"publishedAt":"37i","createdAt":"37i","modifiedAt":"37i"},{"name":"eg"},["37k"],{"name":"2f2"},{"id":"37d","headline":"37e","caption":"37f","altText":"36r","url":"37h","encodingFormat":"1hd","height":"1he","width":"1hf","date":"37j","authors":"37l","source":"37m"},{"type":"1h7","image":"37n"},{"type":"eb","element":"1dj","html":"eh"},["36n","370","37c","37o","37p"],["36m"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"37q","text":"37r"},"2024-09-30T10:21:00.911Z","2024-09-30T12:56:06.704Z",{"createdAt":"37t","publishedAt":"37t","modifiedAt":"37u"},{"primary":"36m","seo":"36m"},"Photos show aftermath of Israeli airstrike in Beirut's southern suburbs",{"primary":"37x","seo":"37x","social":"37x"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57413",{"primary":"380"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"382"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"384"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"386"},{"analysis":"383","citations":"385","verdict":"387"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"36b","authors":"36l","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"37s","date":"37v","description":"37w","headline":"37y","presentation":"37z","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"381","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"388","replies":"389"},"rcrd57421",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1e8"},["38c"],[],{"primary":"1ee"},{"altText":"eh","height":"1ed","url":"38f","width":"1ed"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"38d","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"1eb","email":"eh","jobTitle":"38e","name":"1e8","primaryImage":"38g","publisher":"38h","socialMediaProfiles":"38i","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"38j","educationAndExpertise":"38k","awards":"38l"},["38m"],"Iran will not leave any of “the criminal acts” of Israel unanswered, Iranian Foreign Ministry spokesperson Nasser Kanaani said this morning, after the killing of Hezbollah’s chief and an Iranian Revolutionary Guard deputy commander in Lebanon.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"38o"},"Brigadier General Abbas Nilforoushan was also killed in <a href=\"https://www.reuters.com/world/middle-east/irans-parliament-speaker-says-militant-groups-will-go-confronting-israel-2024-09-29/\" target=\"_blank\">Israeli strikes on Beirut</a> on Friday.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"38q"},"“We stand strongly and we will act in a way that is regretful [for the enemy],” Kanaani told a weekly news conference, adding that Iran does not seek war but is not afraid of it.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"38s"},["38p","38r","38t"],"Brigadier General Abbas Nilforoushan was also killed in Israeli strikes on Beirut on Friday.",["38o","38v","38s"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"38u","text":"38w"},"2024-09-30T09:04:14.812Z","2024-09-30T09:29:24.592Z",{"createdAt":"38y","publishedAt":"38y","modifiedAt":"38z"},"Iran will not leave any of “the criminal acts” of Israel unanswered, Iranian Foreign Ministry spokesperson Nasser Kanaani said this morning, after the killing",{"primary":"391","seo":"391"},"Iran will not leave Israel’s ‘criminal acts’ unanswered, says foreign ministry ",{"primary":"393","seo":"393","social":"393"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57421",{"primary":"396"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"398"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"39a"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"39c"},{"analysis":"399","citations":"39b","verdict":"39d"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"38b","authors":"38n","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"38x","date":"390","description":"392","headline":"394","presentation":"395","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"397","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"39e","replies":"39f"},"rcrd57418",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2bd"},["39i"],[],{"primary":"2bk"},{"altText":"eh","height":"2bj","url":"39l","width":"2bj"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"39j","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"2bg","email":"eh","jobTitle":"39k","name":"2bi","primaryImage":"39m","publisher":"39n","socialMediaProfiles":"39o","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"39p","educationAndExpertise":"39q","awards":"39r"},["39s"],"The deputy secretary general of Hezbollah, Naem Qassem, is set to make a speech shortly.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"39u"},"It's the first major public comment from the militant group since the killing of former longtime leader Hassan Nasrallah in an Israeli attack. The Iran-backed group has yet to announce his replacement. ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"39w"},["39v","39x"],["39u","39w"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"39y","text":"39z"},"2024-09-30T08:38:13.532Z","2024-09-30T09:29:54.793Z",{"createdAt":"3a1","publishedAt":"3a1","modifiedAt":"3a2"},{"primary":"39u","seo":"39u"},"Senior Hezbollah official to give first speech since Nasrallah killing",{"primary":"3a5","seo":"3a5","social":"3a5"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57418",{"primary":"3a8"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"3aa"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"3ac"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"3ae"},{"analysis":"3ab","citations":"3ad","verdict":"3af"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"39h","authors":"39t","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"3a0","date":"3a3","description":"3a4","headline":"3a6","presentation":"3a7","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"3a9","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"3ag","replies":"3ah"},"rcrd57411",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2bd"},["3ak"],[],{"primary":"2bk"},{"altText":"eh","height":"2bj","url":"3an","width":"2bj"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"3al","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"2bg","email":"eh","jobTitle":"3am","name":"2bi","primaryImage":"3ao","publisher":"3ap","socialMediaProfiles":"3aq","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"3ar","educationAndExpertise":"3as","awards":"3at"},{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"1vr"},["3av"],["1vw"],{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"3aw","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"1vu","email":"1vv","jobTitle":"3ax","name":"1vy","primaryImage":"eh","publisher":"3ay","socialMediaProfiles":"3az","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"3b0","educationAndExpertise":"3b1","awards":"3b2"},["3au","3b3"],"The Popular Front for the Liberation of Palestine has said that three of its leaders were killed in an Israeli airstrike on central Beirut's Cola district.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"3b5"},"It listed Mohammed Abdel Aal, Emad Odeh, and Abdel Rahman Abdel Aal among the deceased.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"3b7"},"The leftist PFLP is designated a terrorist group by the U.S., but it is also a member of the Palestine Liberation Organization, a coalition recognized by the United Nations as the official representative of the Palestinians.  ",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"3b9"},"Israeli officials are yet to comment on the strike on the Cola district.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"3bb"},["3b6","3b8","3ba","3bc"],["3b5","3b7","3b9","3bb"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"3bd","text":"3be"},"2024-09-30T08:21:00.473Z","2024-09-30T12:57:13.852Z",{"createdAt":"3bg","publishedAt":"3bg","modifiedAt":"3bh"},{"primary":"3b5","seo":"3b5"},"PFLP says three leaders killed in Israeli strike",{"primary":"3bk","seo":"3bk","social":"3bk"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57411",{"primary":"3bn"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"3bp"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"3br"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"3bt"},{"analysis":"3bq","citations":"3bs","verdict":"3bu"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"3aj","authors":"3b4","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"3bf","date":"3bi","description":"3bj","headline":"3bl","presentation":"3bm","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"3bo","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"3bv","replies":"3bw"},"rcrd57409","Rudy Chinchilla is a breaking news editor for NBC News Digital.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"3bz"},["3c0"],"ncpn1263830","rudy.chinchilla1@nbcuni.com",[],"Rudy Chinchilla",{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/author/rudy-chinchilla-ncpn1263830","rudy-chinchilla-ncpn1263830",{"canonical":"3c8","primary":"3c8","slug":"3c9"},[],[],[],{"bio":"3c1","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"3bz","id":"3c2","email":"3c3","jobTitle":"3c4","name":"3c5","primaryImage":"eh","publisher":"3c6","socialMediaProfiles":"3c7","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"3ca","worksFor":"eh","experience":"3cb","educationAndExpertise":"3cc","awards":"3cd"},{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"nc"},["3cf"],["ni"],{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"nm","youtube":"eh"},{"canonical":"no","primary":"no","slug":"np"},{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"nr"},["3cl"],[],[],{"bio":"3cg","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"nf","id":"ng","email":"nh","jobTitle":"3ch","name":"nk","primaryImage":"eh","publisher":"3ci","socialMediaProfiles":"3cj","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"3ck","worksFor":"eh","experience":"3cm","educationAndExpertise":"3cn","awards":"3co"},["3ce","3cp"],"An apparent Israeli airstrike struck a building in the central Beirut neighborhood of Cola last night, according to videos posted to social media.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"3cr"},"The videos, geolocated by NBC News, show damage to the multistory building as debris is seen on the ground below. People are also seen gathering around the structure as multiple ambulances converge on the area.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"3ct"},"rcim316797",{"primary":"eh","tease":"eh","seo":"eh","social":"eh"}," ","Israel hit a Beirut apartment block on September 30, killing three members of a Palestinian armed group in its first strike on the city centre since the outbreak of the Gaza war last year. ","https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2024-09/240930-beirut-strike-wc-0822-c3593c.jpg",{"primary":"3cz"},"2024-09-30T07:23:15.623Z",{"publishedAt":"3d1","createdAt":"3d1","modifiedAt":"3d1"},{"name":"eg"},["3d3"],{"name":"2f2"},{"id":"3cv","headline":"3cw","caption":"3cx","altText":"3cy","url":"3d0","encodingFormat":"1hd","height":"1he","width":"1hf","date":"3d2","authors":"3d4","source":"3d5"},{"type":"1h7","image":"3d6"},"It was not immediately clear whether there were deaths or injuries related to the reported strike, nor was it clear that the strike was intentionally aimed at Cola.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"3d8"},"Cola, a stone’s throw from downtown Beirut, is known as a busy neighborhood and is the location of a bus station. This would be the first Israeli strike on the heart of the Lebanese capital during this round of conflict.",{"ty