},["3ea"],"Sen. Mark Kelly says he’s not ready to condition U.S. aid to IsraelNetanyahu, not Biden, is setting the agenda in the Middle East",["3ec"],{"markupAndEmbeds":"3eb","text":"3ed"},"2024-09-30T08:12:16.771Z",{"createdAt":"3ef","publishedAt":"3ef","modifiedAt":"3ef"},"Sen.",{"primary":"3eh","seo":"3eh"},"Catch up with our latest coverage",{"primary":"3ej","seo":"3ej","social":"3ej"},{"style":"fg"},"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/live-blog/israel-hezbollah-live-updates-hamas-leader-lebanon-killed-strike-hits-rcna173218#rcrd57414",{"primary":"3em"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"3eo"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"3eq"},[],{"markupAndEmbeds":"3es"},{"analysis":"3ep","citations":"3er","verdict":"3et"},[],{"nativeAd":"e2","id":"3dx","authors":"3e7","isHeadlineHidden":"e2","content":"3ee","date":"3eg","description":"3ei","headline":"3ek","presentation":"3el","primaryImage":"eh","teaseImage":"eh","url":"3en","reportingFrom":"eh","factCheckContent":"3eu","replies":"3ev"},"rcrd57408",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"2bd"},["3ey"],[],{"primary":"2bk"},{"altText":"eh","height":"2bj","url":"3f1","width":"2bj"},{"name":"em","subType":"eh","type":"en"},{"email":"eh","facebook":"eh","instagram":"eh","pinterest":"eh","snapchat":"eh","twitter":"eh","youtube":"eh"},[],[],[],{"bio":"3ez","liveBlogShortBio":"eg","shortBio":"eh","id":"2bg","email":"eh","jobTitle":"3f0","name":"2bi","primaryImage":"3f2","publisher":"3f3","socialMediaProfiles":"3f4","subType":"eh","type":"eq","url":"eh","worksFor":"eh","experience":"3f5","educationAndExpertise":"3f6","awards":"3f7"},["3f8"],"Hamas says Fateh Sherif Abu Al-Amin, the group’s leader in Lebanon, has been killed in an Israeli airstrike in the country's south.",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"3fa"},"In a statement posted on Telegram, the Palestinian militant group said Al-Amin was killed alongside his wife and children \"in their home in the (Al-Bas) camp.\"",{"type":"eb","element":"ec","html":"3fc"},"While Hamas is based in Gaza, it has lo